{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Homecoming\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"An older and stronger Naruto returns from his two and a half years of training with Jiraiya. When he gets back he finds that many things have changed since he left. From Konohamaru becoming a Gennin and being under the supervision of Ebisu to Tsunade's, the Fifth Hokage, being added to the great stone faces. Now the tasks of starting things where they were left has begun. And what new danger does Jiraiya know about?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/320623.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"帰郷\"},{\"title\":\"Akatsuki Begins Their Move\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As Naruto gets back into the swing of things and meets back up with what is left of Team 7, Kakashi and Sakura, Jiraiya has something important to tell them. It seems a shinobi group known as Akatsuki is on the move. The things they are after are the tailed beasts like the one inside of Naruto, the Kyubi. Is Naruto prepared to defend himself from this group of Shinobi?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/320624.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"暁, 始動\"},{\"title\":\"The results of training\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-22\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The bell test begins again while Tsunade, Jiraiya, and Shizune watch, but this time Kakashi is taking things seriously. So serious that he is using his Sharingan. Can Naruto and Sakura get the bells before the deadline? Meanwhile Gaara searches for the Akatsuki member that has invaded the village.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/320625.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"修行の成果\"},{\"title\":\"Jinchuuriki of the Sand\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-01\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The bell test continues for Naruto and Sakura. Meanwhile Gaara discovers that the Akatsuki member, Deidara, has infiltrated the village. Now the battle begins between Gaara and Deidara. With Deidara after Shukaku which is sealed in Gaara, can the older and more powerful Gaara defeat this powerful foe?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/320626.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"砂の人柱力\"},{\"title\":\"As the Kazekage...!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara and Deidara continue their fight with Gaara gaining the upper hand. Deidara then begins to attack the village and Gaara, the Kazekage, must protect it. Can Gaara defeat Deidara or is he playing right into his hands.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/320628.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"風影として...!\"},{\"title\":\"Quota Clear!\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-29\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Deidara launches an attack on the village and Gaara must do his duty as Kazekage and protect it. However, Gaara's left himself wide open for an attack!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/323113.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ノルマクリアー!\"},{\"title\":\"Sprinting Kankurou\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-29\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With Gaara captured and abducted, Kankuro goes after Deidara to get him back. However, his path is soon blocked by Sasori, whom doesn't plan on letting him pass.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/323114.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"疾走れカンクロウ\"},{\"title\":\"Excursion, Kakashi`s Group\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-12\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With their leader abducted, the Hidden Sand Village requests assistance from Konoha. Tsunade sends Naruto, Sakura, and Kakashi out to help. Worried about her little brother, Temari tags along as well.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/327595.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"出撃, カカシ班\"},{\"title\":\"Jinchuuriki Tears\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-12\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As the group travels to Hidden Sand Village, Naruto realizes that Sakura doesn't know why Akatsuki are after Gaara and himself. Has the time finally come to tell her the truth?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/327596.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人柱力の涙\"},{\"title\":\"Sealing Technique - Complete Nine Mystical Dragon Seal\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-19\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With Kankuro injured, Chiyo and Ebizou make an appearance in order to save his life. They try everything, but it's all in vain and Kankuro's condition is progressively getting worse. Meanwhile, Sasori and Deidara arrive at the Akatsuki hideout and begin extracting Shukaku from Gaara using a mysterious technique.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/327597.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"封印術・幻龍九封尽\"},{\"title\":\"Apprentice of the Medical Ninja\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-26\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Upon arriving at the Sand Village's medical center, Kakashi is attacked by an elderly woman. Who is this woman and why is she attacking Kakashi? Meanwhile, Sakura does an examination on Kankuro and figures out that he's in bad shape. Can she use what Tsunade taught her in order to save Kankuro's life?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/327598.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"医療忍者の弟子\"},{\"title\":\"The Retired Old Woman`s Determination\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-03\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"When Pakkun discovers the whereabouts of the Akatsuki's hideout, Kakashi orders Pakkun to find Gai and his team and lead them to the position. Meanwhile, Kakashi and his group decide to head out with Temari and other sand ninjas, but Chiyo decides to go in her place. Will this old woman help or hinder the mission?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/328449.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"隠居ババアの決意\"},{\"title\":\"Destined Meeting\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-10\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"While Gai's group must fight against Kisame in order to proceed, Kakashi's group is cut off by another familiar face...Itachi Uchiha! Kakashi and Naruto team up and face the legendary ninja, but will even that be enough?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/328450.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"因縁あいまみえる\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Growth\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-17\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"While Gai, Lee, Tenten and Neji continue their battle against Kisame, Naruto and Kakashi work together to fight Itachi. But when Itachi puts Naruto in a genjutsu spell, can Naruto find a way to break free?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/328451.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトの成長\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden sphere, It`s name is...\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-24\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The fights against Itachi and Kisame finally come to an end, but are these the real Itachi and Kisame?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/328452.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"隠し玉 名付けて...!\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret Behind Jinchuuriki\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-31\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As the group draws closer to Akatsuki's hideout, Chiyo reveals some startling information about the Jinchuuriki. Naruto becomes more determined than ever to rescue Gaara, but is it too late to save him?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/328453.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人柱力の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Gaara dies!\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-07\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The group has finally arrived at the Akatsuki hideout, but is it already too late to save Gaara?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/329899.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"我愛羅死す!\"},{\"title\":\"Break in! Button Hook Entry\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-21\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Knowing that Akatsuki's lair is protected by a powerful barrier, Kakashi and Gai decide that the teams must work together to dismantle the barrier.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/330140.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"突入! ボタンフックエントリー\"},{\"title\":\"Trap Operation! Team Gai`s Enemy\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-05\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As Gai's team stays behind to fight a group of mysterious enemies, Kakashi's team enters the Akatsuki hideout, where Naruto makes an unhappy discovery.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/330141.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"罠[トラップ]作動! ガイ班の敵\"},{\"title\":\"Hiruko vs Two Female Ninja\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-19\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Chiyo and Sakura team up to fight Sasori, but soon realize that if they get something even as small as scratch, it's all over. Can the two defeat this puppet master?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/332019.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒルコVS二人の女忍者\"},{\"title\":\"True Face of Sasori\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-26\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With his puppet destroyed, Sasori reveals himself to Chiyo and Sakura, looking no older than when he left his village twenty years ago. As a further bit of nostalgia, he produces a summoning scroll and calls forth the Third Kazekage, whom Sasori has made into a puppet. Using its weapons, which are even more dangerous than Hiruko's, Sasori is able to catch Sakura in a poison gas cloud. Meanwhile, Kankuro, Temari's team, and Ebizo make their way to the Akatsuki hideout.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/332501.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"サソリの素顔\"},{\"title\":\"Chiyo`s Inner Hand\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-02\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura manages to escape the poison gas cloud by using an explosive scroll on herself. Chiyo calls forth the \\\"Mother\\\" and \\\"Father\\\" puppets that Sasori created to fight him and the Third. They manage to hold down the Third for awhile until Sasori releases the Third's secret technique: Iron Sand. Meanwhile, Team Guy are having trouble fighting the clones and showing exhaustion from the battle. Naruto and Kakashi manage to avoid Deidara's clay bombs and keep up with him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333121.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"チヨの奥の手\"},{\"title\":\"\\\"Father\\\" and \\\"Mother\\\"\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-02\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The Iron Sand stops both puppets from moving. Chiyo's right arm (which she had turned into a puppet) gets clogged and broken as well. Chiyo thinks back to the past and remembers how Sasori created and controled his first puppets, Father and Mother. Sakura urges Chiyo to use her again as her puppet. With Chiyo's help, Sakura avoids the columns formed by the Iron Sand to attack her.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333122.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"『父』と『母』\"},{\"title\":\"The Third Kazekage\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-09\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Chiyo and Sakura must try and defeat Sasori's strongest puppet, the Third Kazekage.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333123.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"三代目風影\"},{\"title\":\"Between Life and Death in Three Minutes\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-16\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura has managed to destroy Sasori's strongest puppet, but he still has a few tricks up sleeve. And although Sakura's managed to avoid a fatal blow from the poison, she and Chiyo must defeat him in three minutes before the antidote wears off and they are vulnerable to Sasori's attacks. Can they defeat him in time?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333124.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"生と死の三分間\"},{\"title\":\"10 Puppets VS 100 Puppets\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-23\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Chiyo uses her abilities as a master puppeteer to allow her to control ten puppets at once against Sasori. However, Sasori has gone a step ahead, and gained the ability to control one hundred puppets at once! Can Chiyo defeat the man who took down an entire country?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333125.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"十機VS百機\"},{\"title\":\"The Dream that Couldn`t Come True\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-30\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"It's the final stand against Sasori, and Chiyo reveals the flaw in Sasori's \\\"immortality\\\". As Sasori breathes his last breaths, he rewards the two kunoichi for his defeat by providing them some valuable information. In ten days, they will have the opportunity to meet with one of his spies who can provide them with information on Orochimaru, and Sasuke as well.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/333795.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"叶わぬ夢\"},{\"title\":\"The Resurrected Beasts\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-13\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As Kakashi and Naruto chase after Deidara, and Sakura and Chiyo rest from their fight with Sasori, Gai and his team continue to fight their doppelgangers. Things aren't looking good for the four as the doppelgangers remain at the same strength while Gai's team grows weaker. Can they finish things up, or will it be the end of the line for them?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/335155.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"蘇る獣たち\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi Open Eyes!\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-27\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi unleashes his new Mangekyo Sharingan against Deidara, turning the tide of the battle in their favor, but when Naruto begins to act strangely, Kakashi sees him as the bigger threat.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/335156.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシ開眼!\"},{\"title\":\"Esthetics of a Moment\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-27\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi must act quickly to calm Naruto down before he releases too much of Kyubi's power. Meanwhile, Deidara is cornered by Gai's team, and when he realizes that he can't defeat them, he decides that the only way he'll die is he takes everyone else with him!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/335157.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"瞬間の美学\"},{\"title\":\"Thing to be Inherited\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-18\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara's body has finally been recovered, and Chiyo determines that there is only one way to save him. It's up to her and the entire village to prove to Gaara that he is loved, and Naruto shows Gaara that he does have a friend.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/342665.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"継がれゆくもの\"},{\"title\":\"The Return of Kazekage\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-25\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Now that Gaara's been revived, the Hidden Sand Village slowly begins to return to normal. It's time for the ninja of Konoha to take their leave, and Naruto shows Gaara how friends say goodbye. Meanwhile, a mysterious ninja tries to join Akatsuki.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79824/340333.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"風影の帰還\"},{\"title\":\"A New Target\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Everyone has returned to the Hidden Leaf Village. Kakashi is hospitalized for a week due to the strain caused by his Mangekyo Sharingan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172558/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"新たなる目標[ターゲット]\"},{\"title\":\"The New Team Kakashi is Formed!\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After attacking Naruto, Sai predicts that they will meet again soon, then vanishes. Tsunade meets with the village elders, Homura and Koharu…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172559/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"結成! 新カカシ班\"},{\"title\":\"An unnecessary action\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is enraged when he discovers that Sai attacked him in order to test his strength. Sakura pulls them apart, but tensions are running high between the members of Team Kakashi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172560/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"画蛇添足\"},{\"title\":\"Feigned smile\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The new Team Kakashi heads for Tenchikyo. To Naruto, Sai is just temporarily filling in for Sasuke. When Sai shows his contempt for Sasuke, the antagonism comes to a head.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172561/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"偽りの笑顔\"},{\"title\":\"Untitled\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura comes across Sai working on an abstract painting. He tells her that he`s unable to give it a title. Bothered by his manner, Sakura finds an unusual picture book among Sai`s things.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172562/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"無題\"},{\"title\":\"Simulation\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In preparation for Tenchikyo, Yamato conducts a half-day simulation in order to get a grasp on the fighting skills and jutsu of Team Kakashi. Sai abandons Naruto to conclude the simulated mission successfully.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172563/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"模擬戦闘訓練[シミュレーション]\"},{\"title\":\"The Heaven and Earth Bridge\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The day for capturing the spy is finally here. Just as planned, Yamato takes on Sasori`s likeness and waits until the Akatsuki spy appears. The spy turns out to be none other than Kabuto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172564/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"天地橋\"},{\"title\":\"Kyuubi Unleashed\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faced with Orochimaru, his sworn enemy, Naruto suddenly releases the power of his Nine-Tailed Fox. When Yamato sees Naruto`s fourth tail appear, he recalls Jiraiya`s tale of how he nearly lost his life to the transformed Naruto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172565/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"九尾解放!!\"},{\"title\":\"Top-Secret Mission Start\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When his third tail appears, all that Naruto can see is Orochimaru. He is blind even to his teammates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172566/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"極秘任務スタート\"},{\"title\":\"Orochimaru VS Jinchuuriki\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the release of his fourth tail, Naruto completely loses his awareness and is overtaken by destructive impulses.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172567/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大蛇丸VS人柱力\"},{\"title\":\"Sakura`s Tears\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Although he has changed almost completely into his animal form and has lost all awareness, Naruto refuses to give up the idea of bringing Sasuke home.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172568/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"サクラの涙\"},{\"title\":\"Facts of the Fight\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Taking advantage of the confusion, Sai makes contact with Orochimaru. After reviewing the contents of the documents given to him, Orochimaru decides to take Sai back to the hideout.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172569/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"戦いの顛末\"},{\"title\":\"The Result of the Betrayal\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sakura are shocked when they hear that Danzo`s goal is to work with Orochimaru to once again attempt to defeat the Leaf Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172570/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切りの果て\"},{\"title\":\"The Unfinished Page\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is shocked to learn that he was the one responsible for the destruction around them and for Sakura`s injuries.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172571/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"未完の頁[ページ]\"},{\"title\":\"Sneak In! Den of the Poisonous Snake\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sai shudders when he finally meets Sasuke face to face in Orochimaru`s hideout. The list that Sai gave to Orochimaru lists the members of the Anbu Black Ops, the corps under the direct control of the Hokage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172572/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入! 毒蛇の巣窟[アジト]\"},{\"title\":\"Bonds\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi is able to find Sai with Yamato guiding them. They immediately begin questioning Sai about Danzo`s plans for destroying the Leaf Village, and surprisingly, Sai divulges everything.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172573/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"つながり\"},{\"title\":\"Important Person\",\"number\":49,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto carries out a surprise attack on Team Kakashi to take back Sai, but a change has come over Sai since Sakura pointed out his contradictions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172574/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大切なモノ\"},{\"title\":\"The Sketch Book Tells a Story\",\"number\":50,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, while nursing his injuries caused by the release of the Nine-Tailed Fox, searches frantically for Sasuke. Seeing this, Sai recalls the feelings he once had for his older brother and finally manages to complete his unfinished picture.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172575/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"絵本が語る物語[ストーリー]\"},{\"title\":\"Reunion\",\"number\":51,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi are stunned to learn that Sai`s true mission is to kill Sasuke.  Naruto wants to believe that the smile Sai showed them was real, but there is a possibility that it was all an act.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172576/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"再会\"},{\"title\":\"Strength of Uchiha\",\"number\":52,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi finally have their wish to be reunited with Sasuke granted. Although it has been three long years, Sasuke`s feelings have not changed. His ultimate goal is to get revenge against his older brother, Itachi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172577/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"うちはの力\"},{\"title\":\"Title\",\"number\":53,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke`s desire for revenge remains firm, no matter how hard Naruto tries to talk him out of it. Yamato tries to take Sasuke by force, but interference by Orochimaru brings things to a quick close.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/172578/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"題名[タイトル]\"},{\"title\":\"Nightmare\",\"number\":54,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto has a strange nightmare several days after their failure to bring Sasuke home. Even after he awakens wisps of the dream keep haunting him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢\"},{\"title\":\"Wind\",\"number\":55,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto begins to train with Kakashi. Kakashi finds it exhausting working with Naruto, who can’t understand anything explained to him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"旋風[かぜ]\"},{\"title\":\"Squirm\",\"number\":56,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Learning that his chakra is of the \\\"wind\\\" type that is outstanding for fighting, Naruto puts more effort into his training.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うごめく\"},{\"title\":\"Deprived of Eternal Sleep\",\"number\":57,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi is ordered to resolve the frequent vandalizing of graves at the Fire Temple. When it becomes clear that the vandals aren’t after the possessions buried with the dead, Yamato suspects that they want the corpses of the ninja buried in the four hidden tombs near Fire Temple.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奪われた永眠[ねむ]り\"},{\"title\":\"Loneliness\",\"number\":58,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Fire Temple, Chiriku explains to Team Kakashi that the hidden tombs hold the guards of the Land of Fire’s feudal lord. At one time Chiriku and Asuma were members of that organization.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"孤独\"},{\"title\":\"New Enemy\",\"number\":59,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Word comes that the last of the hidden graves has been broken into. Naruto and the others go after the coffin, but it turns out to be a trap.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな敵\"},{\"title\":\"Mutability\",\"number\":60,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi is split up by the enemy`s Earth Summoning Jutsu. They are forced to fight the attacking assassins, but the enemy has the advantage since they know the lay of the land.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"有為転変\"},{\"title\":\"Contact\",\"number\":61,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sora confronts Furido, the mysterious figure who has broken into the hidden graves. Impressed by Sora’s unusual strength, he admonishes him, “You should reevaluate how you use that power Heaven has blessed you with,” and disappears, leaving him with a cryptic message that he is an old friend of his father.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"接触\"},{\"title\":\"Teammate\",\"number\":62,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yamato believes that the assailants were not grave robbers but were after Sora. He decides to appoint Sora to Team Kakashi as a temporary stand-in for the injured Sai.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"チームメイト\"},{\"title\":\"Two Kings\",\"number\":63,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"By chance, Naruto and Sora get Asuma to coach them. Under the guidance of Asuma’s iron fist, they immerse themselves in training with Wind Chakra.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二つの玉[ぎょく]\"},{\"title\":\"Jet-Black Signal Fire\",\"number\":64,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade catches Danzo in a secret meeting with a ninja from the Hidden Rain Village. But the ninja turns out to be a spy for the Hidden Leaf.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"漆黒の狼煙\"},{\"title\":\"Lockdown of Darkness\",\"number\":65,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Under cover of a giant power outage, Furido begins his assault on the Hidden Leaf. The village immediately goes on alert, but Furido’s men put up a barrier, and everyone in the village is trapped inside.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暗黒の施錠\"},{\"title\":\"Revived Souls\",\"number\":66,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to stop the impending disaster, Asuma rushes toward the electric generator system. There he sees the Guardian Shinobi Twelve who have come to life once more through Revival Jutsu after their graves were robbed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄泉がえる魂\"},{\"title\":\"Multiple Death Matches\",\"number\":67,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sora is speechless when he discovers that Furido not only intends to assassinate the Hokage but plans to totally annihilate Hidden Leaf Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"それぞれの死闘\"},{\"title\":\"Time of Awakening\",\"number\":68,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Throughout the village, Kitane’s fellow Guardian Shinobi with the Lightning Jutsu set up Limelight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"覚醒[めざ]めの刻\"},{\"title\":\"Despair\",\"number\":69,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Asuma catch up to Sora, only to find him shrouded in ominous chakra and undergoing a change.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望\"},{\"title\":\"Resonance\",\"number\":70,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Furido’s true form belongs to Kazuma, one of the Guardian Shinobi Twelve who had planned the coup d’état. Asuma puts his honor on the line and goes back ten years to battle Furido once more.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"共鳴\"},{\"title\":\"Friends\",\"number\":71,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto desperately tries to suppress Nine Tails’ chakra and get through to Sora’s heart and soul. Naruto’s comrades are helpless against Sora’s powerful chakra and can only stand by and watch.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友よ\"},{\"title\":\"A Creeping Threat\",\"number\":72,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Work continues in Hidden Leaf Village to erase the scars of battle. As he watches Konohamaru and the others helping with the reconstruction, Iruka sees how his students have matured.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍び寄る脅威\"},{\"title\":\"Invasion of Akatsuki\",\"number\":73,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Kakashi’s return, Naruto resumes training for his new jutsu. Kakashi explains that the transformation training will enter the next stage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暁侵攻\"},{\"title\":\"Under the Starry Sky\",\"number\":74,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The lone surviving priest is carried into Hidden Leaf Village where he reports the destruction of the Fire Temple.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星空の下で\"},{\"title\":\"The Old Monk`s Prayer\",\"number\":75,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In order to capture the Akatsuki, the Hidden Leaf cast a net that even an ant could not crawl through. Still, the Akatsuki elude them and frustrate Tsunade to no end.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"老僧の祈り\"},{\"title\":\"The Next Step\",\"number\":76,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is learning the elements of Wind Style Jutsu, and Kakashi lectures him on the difficulties of developing a new jutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"次なる段階[ステップ]\"},{\"title\":\"The Climbing Silver\",\"number\":77,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Asuma and his team finally confront Hidan, and a battle ensues. They fight with all their strength but are shocked at Hidan’s power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"棒銀\"},{\"title\":\"Given Judgment\",\"number\":78,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hidan releases a baffling jutsu, and Asuma bears the brunt of the attack. The jutsu is a special trick which links Hidan with Asuma’s body.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"下された裁き\"},{\"title\":\"Unfulfilled Scream\",\"number\":79,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru unravels the secret of Hidan’s jutsu just in time, and Asuma attacks with all his being.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"届かぬ絶叫\"},{\"title\":\"Last Words\",\"number\":80,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Asuma is mortally wounded by Hidan’s jutsu, and the Akatsuki have the rest of the Hidden Leaf in a bind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最期の言葉\"},{\"title\":\"The Sad News\",\"number\":81,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In a faraway land, the Akatsuki reveal their true aim of world conquest. And back at Hidden Leaf Village, Shikamaru gives his report of the mission to Tsunade.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しき報せ\"},{\"title\":\"Team 10\",\"number\":82,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Asuma’s funeral is held in Hidden Leaf Village amid deep sadness. Shikamaru is the lone absentee, unable to get over the loss.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第十班\"},{\"title\":\"Target: Lock On\",\"number\":83,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi and Team 10 set out to stop the Akatsuki. Tsunade considers Naruto’s Team 7 to be the ideal back-up for Team 10 and orders Naruto to perfect his new jutsu within 24 hours.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"標的捕捉[ターゲット・ロックオン]\"},{\"title\":\"Kakuzu`s Abilities\",\"number\":84,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru and Choji deliver the first blows in the battle, but they are thwarted by Kakuzu’s power. Kakashi counters Kakuzu’s trick and brings him down.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"角都の能力\"},{\"title\":\"The Terrifying Secret\",\"number\":85,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru and his comrades desperately counter the Fire Jutsu offensive. But continuously using his Rasengan and Lightning Blade takes its toll on Kakashi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐るべき秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Genius\",\"number\":86,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru battles Hidan alone, deep in the forest, and after depleting his chakra, sustains a deep wound. Hidan draws his blood as he lies near death.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマルの才\"},{\"title\":\"When You Curse Someone, You Dig Your Own Grave\",\"number\":87,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Team Kakashi arrive just in time to assist Team Asuma. Sakura and Sai are ordered by Kakashi to aid Shikamaru, who is battling alone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"人を呪わば穴二つ\"},{\"title\":\"Wind Release: Spiraling Shuriken\",\"number\":88,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ino and Choji are amazed at Naruto’s new jutsu, and Kakuzu senses the danger that it poses. But when released, the new jutsu dissipates before it reaches Kakuzu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"風遁・螺旋手裏剣!\"},{\"title\":\"Compensation for Power\",\"number\":89,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto’s uses his new jutsu to bring Kakuzu down. Tsunade welcomes the teams back home and orders Team Asuma and Team Yamato to take a break.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力の代償\"},{\"title\":\"Shinobi`s Decision\",\"number\":90,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Just when peace has finally settled over the village word comes that Orochimaru’s hideout has been found. Tsunade orders Kakashi, Hinato, Shino, and Kiba on a search mission to find the hideout.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍の決意\"},{\"title\":\"Discovery - Orochimaru`s Hideout\",\"number\":91,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Jiraiya arrive at the hot springs resort. As an alternative to the Wind Style: Rasen Shuriken, Jiraiya suggests to Naruto the collaboration ninjutsu with a ninja toad.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"発見 大蛇丸のアジト\"},{\"title\":\"Encounter\",\"number\":92,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside Orochimaru’s hideout Guren witnesses Sasuke defeating a thousand opponents. Meanwhile, Kabuto and Yukimaru conduct their experiment to summon the Three-Tailed Beast.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遭遇\"},{\"title\":\"Communicating Hearts\",\"number\":93,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Believing Naruto’s new jutsu is almost completed, Jiraiya heads off to investigate new information on the Akatsuki’s movements. His arm now healed, Naruto returns to the village to continue his training.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"通い合う心\"},{\"title\":\"Raining All Night\",\"number\":94,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Staying behind at the hideout, Rinji and Gozu become aware of a shinobi following their tracks. At the same time, Kakashi and his team notice that the enemy is using a bat for surveillance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雨一夜\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Amulets\",\"number\":95,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Leaf Village Naruto is busy training with Gamakichi and Gamatatsu. But when he learns that Kakashi and the others are out on a mission to locate Orochimaru’s hideout, Naruto rushes to ask Tsunade if he can join the mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ふたつのお守り\"},{\"title\":\"The Unseeing Enemy\",\"number\":96,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Yamato heads out to provide backup for Team Kakashi. Right before his departure Naruto gets a hint to perfect his new jutsu by entering Gamatatsu’s belly.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"見えざる敵\"},{\"title\":\"Labyrinth of Reflections\",\"number\":97,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"From the results of the analysis of the crystallized Parasitic insects, the enemies currently fighting Kakashi’s team are identified as users of  the Crystal Style, a rare type of jutsu. Still unclear on what Orochimaru’s objective is, Tsunade cannot hide her irritation and anxiety.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"乱反射の迷宮\"},{\"title\":\"The Target Appears\",\"number\":98,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shattering the force field with his newly mastered collaboration jutsu with the toads, Naruto and the reinforcement unit arrive at the battle site. But Naruto’s new jutsu is repulsed by Guren’s ability to crystallize fluids.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"現れた標的\"},{\"title\":\"Raging Tailed Beast\",\"number\":99,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja use The Bat to pursue Guren. Akamaru and Kiba detect a high level of chakra present at their destination. Convinced something abnormal is about to happen, Kakashi sends Naruto to the lake right before entering battle with the enemy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"荒れ狂う尾獣\"},{\"title\":\"Inside Mist\",\"number\":100,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside the heavy mist, the Leaf ninja manage to rendezvous with Naruto. The team tightens their guard when they learn that the mist surrounding the lake causes illusions. The team discovers that the enemy is after the Three-Tailed Beast, and faced with this unexpected development, Kakashi decides to ask for Tsunade’s guidance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"霧の中で\"},{\"title\":\"Everyone`s Feelings\",\"number\":101,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto enters the mist to seek out Yukimaru. Guren stays alert to protect Yukimaru, whose current situation prevents him from moving. When both sides meet, their emotion over Yukimaru sparks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"それぞれの想い\"},{\"title\":\"Reorganization!\",\"number\":102,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Reinforcements arrive from Leaf Village. The new mission from Tsunade: seal the Three-Tailed Beast so it won’t fall into anyone else’s hands and take Yukimaru whose powers are tied to the Tailed Beast into custody.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再編成!\"},{\"title\":\"The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier\",\"number\":103,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja wish to seal the Three-Tailed Beast, and Guren’s team wishes to stop them at any cost. Shizune’s sealing team begins their search as they activate the The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier to trap the Three-Tailed Beast…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結界四方封陣\"},{\"title\":\"Crystal Style Shattered\",\"number\":104,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To protect the The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier necessary to seal the Three-Tailed Beast, Kakashi and Naruto wage their deadly battle against Guren. Sai fights a one-on-one battle with Gozu…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"晶遁崩し\"},{\"title\":\"Barrier Battle\",\"number\":105,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto plans on breaking the Leaf’s The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier from the inside by using Yukimaru’s power and have the Three-Tailed Beast go on a rampage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結界攻防戦\"},{\"title\":\"Red Camellias\",\"number\":106,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To protect Guren from the raging Three Tails, Yuukimaru exerts powers beyond his limits. Moved by his action, Guren now comes to regret her past sin of killing Yuukimaru’s mother.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"赤い椿\"},{\"title\":\"Bitter Enemies Together\",\"number\":107,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To protect Yuukimaru, Naruto and Guren fight alongside each other against the Three-Tailed beast and are swallowed. Inside the beast is an unnatural world filled with limestone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呉越同舟\"},{\"title\":\"Camellia Guidepost\",\"number\":108,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja learn that Naruto is inside the Three-Tailed beast. With no other alternative but to trust Yuukimaru’s mystical senses, Kakashi and the others follow the boy’s guidance and attempt a rescue mission...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"椿の道標\"},{\"title\":\"Cursed Seal Counterattack\",\"number\":109,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the Three-Tailed Beast readily approaching, the Barrier Sealing team is point to make sure it doesn`t surface.  However, Kabuto - unwilling to fail Orochimaru - is out to recapture Yuukimaru at whatever the cost...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呪印の逆襲\"},{\"title\":\"Memories of Sin\",\"number\":110,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto plots to have Three Tails crush the Leaf ninja by sacrificing Yuukimaru’s power and life. Controlled by Yuukimaru, Three Tails’ awesome power is about to break free from the seal, when an unexpected ally saves Shizune’s sealing team.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"罪の記憶\"},{\"title\":\"The Broken Promise\",\"number\":111,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto finally appears before Naruto. Learning that Orochimaru used Guren’s and Yuukimaru’s feelings for his own purposes, an enraged Naruto enters battle against Kabuto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砕かれた約束\"},{\"title\":\"The Place to Return To\",\"number\":112,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja fall back and tend to their wounds. The battle has left everyone with serious injuries. Shizune examines Yuukimaru, who is in a coma, but his body is no longer able to control Three Tails.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"帰るべき場所\"},{\"title\":\"The Great Snake`s Pupil\",\"number\":113,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru agonizes in pain at his hideout, now requiring level-ten medications just to sustain his body. Even with excruciating pain Orochimaru is preparing for his transference ritual, and Kabuto can feel Orochimaru’s further potential. Meanwhile Sasuke also senses the time is coming when he will have to face his mentor...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大蛇の瞳孔\"},{\"title\":\"The Eye of a Hawk\",\"number\":114,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru sheds his old body and transforms into a white serpent. As he attacks Sasuke to obtain his body, Orochimaru remembers the time he found the cast off skin of a white snake in front of his parents’ grave. Driven by his desire for the Sharingan, Orochimaru finally robs Sasuke of his freedom...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鷹の瞳\"},{\"title\":\"Zabuza`s Sword\",\"number\":115,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke has defeated Orochimaru. He then frees Suigetsu, a man trapped inside a water tank, and tells the man to join him. But Suigetsu does not immediately take up Sasuke’s offer…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再不斬大刀\"},{\"title\":\"Keeper of the Iron Prison\",\"number\":116,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke and Suigetsu visit the southern hideout to recruit their next member, Karin. Suigetsu is surprised at the hideout’s low security level but is told that no prisoners can escape thanks to Karin’s abilities. What is Karin’s power that allows her to maintain order and an iron defense?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鉄壁の番人\"},{\"title\":\"Juugo`s North Hideout\",\"number\":117,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke and his team head for the northern hideout to recruit their next member, Jugo. On the way, Karin explains that the northern hideout is a site for conducting horrific human experiments. A ninja with abnormal homicidal impulses, Jugo is the sole carrier of the enzyme necessary to create Orochimaru’s curse mark...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"重吾の北アジト\"},{\"title\":\"Formation!\",\"number\":118,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Slipping past the riot, Sasuke arrives at Jugo’s cell. But Jugo refuses to be released, even going as far as to say he rather die a lonely death than to leave the hideout.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結成!\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi`s Gaiden - The Battlefield of a Boy`s Life!\",\"number\":119,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"More than ten years ago, the rule of the Five Great Shinobi Nations was destabilized, throwing the world into a conflict later to be known as the Third Great Ninja War. The future Fourth Hokage Minato Namikaze assigns young Kakashi, Obito of the Uchiha clan, and Rin, a medical ninja, on a mission to Kannabi Bridge...\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシ外伝~戦場のボーイズライフ~\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi`s Gaiden - The Battlefield of a Boy`s Life!\",\"number\":120,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Obito ignores Kakashi’s order to continue with the mission and leaves to save Rin, who was kidnapped by the Rock ninja. But the enemies detect Obito’s arrival and defeat him. Kakashi arrives at the last minute and saves Obito…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシ外伝~戦場のボーイズライフ~\"},{\"title\":\"Assemble\",\"number\":121,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After hunting down the Four Tails, Itachi and Kisame are summoned by the leader of the Akatsuki. The leader announces the death of Orochimaru to the gathered members and the possibility of his killer, Sasuke, setting his sights on the Akatsuki organization....\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出すものたち\"},{\"title\":\"The Hunt\",\"number\":122,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Under Kakashi’s command, the Leaf ninja set off to find Itachi. Using Kakashi’s ninja hounds, they gather as much information as they can on Itachi. Meanwhile, the members of the Hebi also scatter to look for information on Itachi. Led by the ninja hound tracking Sasuke’s scent, Sakura arrives in town and draws near to Karin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"探索\"},{\"title\":\"Clash!\",\"number\":123,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Upon encountering one another, Sasuke and Deidara engage in battle. After exchanging a few blows to test Sasuke’s strength, Deidara conjures up his specialty clay dragon and wages long-range attacks against Sasuke from high above. With Tobi’s backup support, the battle seems to be going to Deidara.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突!\"},{\"title\":\"Art\",\"number\":124,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Determined to destroy the Sharingan to rid himself of the taste of defeat he received from Itachi, Deidara unleashes his biggest attack, the C4 Karura. Created to kill Itachi, this fierce weapon is capable of destroying living beings from the inside using millions of nano-sized bombs. Can Sasuke escape this attack fueled by Deidara’s determination to destroy the Sharingan?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"芸術\"},{\"title\":\"Disappearance\",\"number\":125,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke goes missing after being caught by Deidara’s suicidal bombing. Sensing his disappearance, Jugo, Karin, and Suigetsu race to Sasuke’s last location, where the three Hebi members discover...?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消失\"},{\"title\":\"Twilight\",\"number\":126,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Leaf ninja, she notifies the others and the Hebi members quickly leave the inn. To allow Sasuke to focus on his coming battle with Itachi, Karin comes up with a plan to keep the Leaf ninja occupied.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄昏\"},{\"title\":\"Tale of a Gutsy Ninja - The Jiraiya Ninja Chronicles\",\"number\":127,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During the reign of the Second Hokage, the young Jiraiya, Orochimaru, and Tsunade are assigned to Hiruzen Sarutobi’s platoon as Genins. Fascinated by Sarutobi’s summoning jutsu, Jiraiya immerses himself in mastering the transportation technique. While training, Jiraiya accidentally transports himself to Mount Myoboku, opening the path to fulfill his destiny.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ド根性忍伝 ~自来也忍法帖~前編\"},{\"title\":\"Tale of a Gutsy Ninja - The Jiraiya Ninja Chronicles\",\"number\":128,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya’s journey to seek out a student is postponed due to the outbreak of the Third Great Ninja War. Jiraiya joins Tsunade and Orochimaru to battle the Village Hidden in the Rain. Following the battle, the three ninja are named the “Legendary Sannin,” a title given to them by the enemy Hanzo of the Great Salamander himself.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ド根性忍伝 ~自来也忍法帖~後編\"},{\"title\":\"Infiltrate! The Village Hidden in the Rain\",\"number\":129,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya successfully infiltrates the Hidden Rain Village by hiding inside the toad Gamagoro. He sets out to gather information but finds no indications of a civil war occurring within the village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入! 雨隠れの里\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Who Became God\",\"number\":130,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Foreseeing a possible battle, Jiraiya takes precautionary measures by releasing the scroll toad that commands the key to Naruto’s Eight-Signed Seal.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神となった男\"},{\"title\":\"Activate! Sage Mode\",\"number\":131,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya battles to defeat his former student Pain, who is now driven by his twisted ideals as an Akatsuki member.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"発動! 仙人モード\"},{\"title\":\"Meeting the Six Paths of Pain\",\"number\":132,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya completes his Sage Mode transformation to battle the three Pains.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペイン六道, 見参\"},{\"title\":\"The Tale of the Gallant Jiraiya\",\"number\":133,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having lost his arm, Jiraiya is outmatched by the six Pains now appearing before him. Of the six, the one called Tendo is revealed to be Jiraiya’s former student Yahiko. Jiraiya is still puzzled by the Rinnegan’s true powers, but before he can gather his thoughts, he is forced back into battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也豪傑物語\"},{\"title\":\"Invitation to the Party\",\"number\":134,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke arrives at one of the Akatsuki hideouts, having followed in Itachi’s footsteps. When Sasuke is about to enter the hideout alone, his older brother Itachi finally appears before him…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"宴会の誘い\"},{\"title\":\"The Longest Moment\",\"number\":135,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Itachi waits for Sasuke in the Uchiha hideout, he recalls the past incident that led to his defection from the Leaf Village. When Sasuke arrives, the fated battle begins between the two brothers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"長き瞬間の中で...\"},{\"title\":\"The Light & Dark of the Mangekyo Sharingan\",\"number\":136,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Following their fierce genjutsu battle with the Sharingan, Itachi explains the secret behind the most powerful ocular jutsu, the Mangekyo Sharingan, and the history of the Uchiha clan…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"万華鏡写輪眼の光と闇\"},{\"title\":\"Amaterasu\",\"number\":137,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke loses his left eye to Itachi, but it turns out to be a genjutsu created by the Mangekyo Sharingan. Breaking free of the Tsukuyomi by force, Sasuke makes a furious comeback against the injured Itachi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天照(あまてらす)\"},{\"title\":\"The End\",\"number\":138,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the climax of the battle, both Itachi and Sasuke run out of chakra. However, Sasuke reveals that his actions up until now were only a preparation for his final jutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"終焉\"},{\"title\":\"The Mystery of Tobi\",\"number\":139,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his comrades find themselves held up by Tobi, whose strange jutsu is more than just a simple genjutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"トビの謎\"},{\"title\":\"Fate\",\"number\":140,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Akatsuki hideout Sasuke comes face to face with Madara. Announcing himself as Itachi’s accomplice from that fateful night, Madara goes on to tell Sasuke the truth about Itachi that he could never have known.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"因縁\"},{\"title\":\"Truth\",\"number\":141,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Uchiha clan was plotting a coup d’etat. The story as told by Madara leaves Sasuke at a loss for words. Because of his gifted talent, Itachi was forced to suffer, torn between his loyalties to the Leaf Village and the Uchiha clan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"真実\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle at Thunder Cloud Gorge\",\"number\":142,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Flame from the Amaterasu still remains on the battlefield as Naruto and his teammates continue to search for Sasuke. But despite the search team’s best efforts, they cannot find any trace of him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雲雷峡の闘い\"},{\"title\":\"Eight-Tails vs. Sasuke\",\"number\":143,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Taka split up with the Akatsuki to hunt down the remaining Tailed Beast. At the Land of Lightning they go up against Killer Bee, whose attack utilizing Lightning Style and seven blades proves to be more than a match for them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"八尾対サスケ\"},{\"title\":\"The Wanderer\",\"number\":144,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja fail to capture Itachi and also lose track of Sasuke. Calling off their pursuit, the team is heading back to the village when an urgent assignment from Lady Tsunade comes in. The mission stems from a treaty between the Third Hokage and the En no Gyoja of the Tsuchigumo Clan...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"風来坊\"},{\"title\":\"Successor of the Forbidden Jutsu\",\"number\":145,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his teammates are assigned to escort Hotaru, En no Gyoja’s granddaughter, to the Tsuchigumo Clan’s village located in the mountains. But Hotaru’s mind is still attached to Utakata, who left after Naruto’s arrival…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁術の継承者\"},{\"title\":\"The Successor`s Wish\",\"number\":146,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having arrived at the village, Hotaru parts with Naruto and his team. But the Magaki Troops are one step ahead and threaten Hotaru to hand over the forbidden jutsu. Utakata appears, and Shiranami recognizes him as a bounty listed in the Hidden Mist’s bingo book...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"継承者の想い\"},{\"title\":\"Rogue Ninja`s Past\",\"number\":147,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yamato and Sai recognize their opponents as trackers from the Hidden Mist Village, but Naruto attacks without questioning. The Hidden Mist demands Utakata be handed over to them in exchange for Hotaru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"抜け忍の過去\"},{\"title\":\"Heir to Darkness\",\"number\":148,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hotaru is brought back to the fort in Mount Katsuragi. Naruto, outraged to learn the forbidden jutsu was embedded inside Hotaru, demands an explanation from Tonbei. But it was none other than Hotaru herself who wished for this.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇の後継者\"},{\"title\":\"Separation\",\"number\":149,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Believing Shiranami’s story, Hotaru writes a parting letter addressed to Utakata and leaves Mount Katsuragi. Meanwhile Naruto, still searching for Shiranami, falls into the Magaki Troops’ trap but manages to escape thanks to help from Utakata.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"別離\"},{\"title\":\"The Forbidden Jutsu Released\",\"number\":150,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Utakata successfully enter the Tsuchigumo village thanks to help from Sakura, Sai, and Yamato. Utakata senses the chakra filling the atmosphere and terrain behaving oddly, and together with Naruto, they enter the cave where the anomaly is originating.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁術発動\"},{\"title\":\"Student and Teacher\",\"number\":151,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hotaru, under the control of Shiranami’s jutsu, uses the Forbidden Jutsu against Naruto and Utakata. Shiranami trembles with joy, having witnessed the power of the Forbidden Jutsu, while Hotaru is consumed by deep despair.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"師弟\"},{\"title\":\"Somber News\",\"number\":152,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Returning from the mission, Naruto recollects his strange encounter with Itachi. What did the now deceased Itachi wish to tell him? As Naruto ponders this, Kakashi makes an abrupt visit.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲報\"},{\"title\":\"Following the Master`s Shadow\",\"number\":153,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto wanders the streets of the Leaf Village, grief stricken over the death of Jiraiya. Unable to overcome his feeling of loss, Naruto traces back through his memories of Jiraiya. What can help the heartbroken Naruto get back on his feet?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"師の影を追って\"},{\"title\":\"Decryption\",\"number\":154,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his friends successfully decipher the code Jiraiya left behind with the help of some information Naruto has. The crew immediately calls Fukasaku over, but the message is not enough to solve the mystery of Pain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暗号解読\"},{\"title\":\"The First Challenge\",\"number\":155,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At Mount Myoboku, Naruto begins his Sage Jutsu training under Fukasaku. The first challenge is “Don’t move.” Fukasaku explains that an extensive amount of time is necessary in order to take in nature energy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第一の課題\"},{\"title\":\"Surpassing the Master\",\"number\":156,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto continues his Sage training at Mount Myoboku, but with very slow progress. Fukasaku runs out of patience and suggests they move on to the next training…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"師を超えるとき\"},{\"title\":\"Konoha Attack\",\"number\":157,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru and the others wait for the information Jiraiya brought back to be analyzed. The Hidden Leaf ninja continue their data analysis, when disaster strikes the village—\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉襲撃!\"},{\"title\":\"The Power to Believe\",\"number\":158,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf Village is under heavy attack from Pain and Konan. Hearing the Akatsuki attack, Tsunade attempts to contact Fukasaku…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"信じる力\"},{\"title\":\"Pain vs. Kakashi\",\"number\":159,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In one area of the village, Kakashi enters battle against Tendo Pain, but he can’t keep up with Tendo’s mysterious attacks. Shurado joins the fight, and Kakashi struggles with the two-on-one disadvantage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペインvsカカシ\"},{\"title\":\"The Mystery of Pain\",\"number\":160,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf Village is under heavy attack from the Akatsuki. Underneath the village Danzo takes action to achieve his ambition. Meanwhile, searching through the Rain ninja’s mind, Inoichi Yamanaka is about to stumble upon valuable information.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペインの謎\"},{\"title\":\"Surname is Sarutobi, given name is Konohamaru\",\"number\":161,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Konohamaru, Moegi, and Udon are shocked to see the disaster that has struck their home village. But to fulfill their duties as genin, each races out to direct the villagers to a safe location.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"姓は猿飛, 名は木ノ葉丸!\"},{\"title\":\"The World Shall Know Pain\",\"number\":162,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade comes face to face with Tendo Pain on the rooftop of the Hokage mansion. When Pain demands the Nine Tails be handed over, Tsunade refuses. However, Pain uses the Ningendo’s power to learn of Naruto’s current location in Mount Myoboku. Tsunade clenches at the sight of the growing number of casualties within the Leaf. But Pain, who condemns the Leaf’s arrogance as a major nation, makes the choice to deliver catastrophic damage against the Leaf Village to teach them what true pain is.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界に痛みを\"},{\"title\":\"Explode! Sage Mode\",\"number\":163,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sensing danger at hand, Naruto, along with Fukasaku, rushes back to the Leaf Village from Mount Myoboku. But what they see is the remains of the Leaf Village, leveled beyond recognition.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"爆発! 仙人モード\"},{\"title\":\"Pinch! Sage Mode Disappears\",\"number\":164,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto hits Pain with his Sage Jutsu-perfected Wind Style Rasen Shuriken. Although he succeeds in defeating Ningendo, the remaining Pain quickly confronts him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"危機(ピンチ)! 消えた仙人モード\"},{\"title\":\"Nine-Tails Captured\",\"number\":165,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gamabunta and the other toads are defeated while Naruto is captured by Pain. Naruto attempts to fight back with Sage Jutsu, but Gakido sucks out his chakra, forcing him to go out of Sage Mode.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"九尾捕獲完了\"},{\"title\":\"Confession\",\"number\":166,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fukasaku and Shima fall in battle, leaving Naruto open to be captured by Tendo Pain. Just when all is thought to be lost, Hinata, who was following the battle with her Byakugan, steps in to face Pain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"告白\"},{\"title\":\"Planetary Devastation\",\"number\":167,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto loses himself after seeing Hinata taken out right before his eyes. His anger  triggers the Nine Tails’ chakra to go out of control.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地爆天星[ちばくてんせい]\"},{\"title\":\"The Fourth Hokage\",\"number\":168,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto meets Minato Namikaze, the Fourth Hokage, inside his inner world. Before his death, Minato planted a fail-safe where he would appear within Naruto’s psyche should his son sprout eight tails.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四代目火影\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Disciples\",\"number\":169,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To break the cycle of hate, Naruto heads to where the real Pain is hiding.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ふたりの弟子\"},{\"title\":\"Big Adventure! Search for the Fourth Hokage`s Legacy - Part 1\",\"number\":170,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The story goes back to right before the start of the final rounds of the Chunin Exam. As Naruto trains in preparation for his upcoming match, he hears Jiraiya speak of “the Fourth Hokage’s legacy.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大冒険! 四代目の遺産を探せ・前編\"},{\"title\":\"Big Adventure! Search for the Fourth Hokage`s Legacy - Part 2\",\"number\":171,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others take on the oncoming challenges in order to find the secret technique and break the previous record set by the Fourth Hokage. But Naruto’s impulsive action leads the group into various troubles.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大冒険! 四代目の遺産を探せ・後編\"},{\"title\":\"Meeting\",\"number\":172,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto comes face to face with Nagato and Konan. Naruto, wanting to confront the problem of their hate-filled ninja world, asks to hear Nagato’s side of the story before coming up with an answer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"出逢い\"},{\"title\":\"The Birth of Pain\",\"number\":173,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To fulfill their dream, Nagato, Yahiko, and Konan walk through the war zone in search of Jiraiya, hoping to learn ninjutsu from him. After completing their training, the three form an organization with Yahiko as its leader.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペイン誕生\"},{\"title\":\"The Tale of Naruto Uzumaki\",\"number\":174,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto remains silent after learning of Nagato’s painful past. Nagato claims true peace cannot exist in this cursed world, dismissing Jiraiya’s ideal as nothing more than wishful thinking.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うずまきナルト物語\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero of the Leaf Village\",\"number\":175,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nagato, having decided to believe in Naruto’s word, performs his last forbidden jutsu: Gedo Art Rinne Rebirth.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉の英雄\"},{\"title\":\"Iruka the Novice Teacher\",\"number\":176,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf Village is left in ruins in the wake of Pain’s assault on the village. While cleaning through the remains of Ninja Academy, Iruka finds an old pillar and recognizes it as a memoir from Naruto’s early years at the academy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新米教師イルカ\"},{\"title\":\"Iruka`s Trials\",\"number\":177,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto spends his days competing with Sasuke, the academy’s star student, only to screw up and be the laughingstock of the class. Due to the childhood trauma of losing his parents to the Nine-Tailed Fox, Iruka finds it difficult to interact with Naruto as his student.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イルカの試練\"},{\"title\":\"Iruka`s Determination\",\"number\":178,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto takes up his classmates’ dare to venture into the forest and retrieve an item from the dead enemy ninja, unaware that the forest is still dangerous.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イルカの決意\"},{\"title\":\"Jounin in Charge Kakashi Hatake\",\"number\":179,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An emergency council is held before the Feudal Lord of the Land of Fire. The topic is to discuss plans to rebuild the Leaf Village, and Danzo strongly urges the council to select a new Hokage to replace Tsunade.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"担当上忍はたけカカシ\"},{\"title\":\"Inari`s Tested Courage\",\"number\":180,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf ninja work to rebuild the Hidden Leaf Village. While helping with the restoration, Naruto and Sakura are reunited with two old friends—the carpenter Tazuna and his grandson Inari from the Land of Waves.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イナリ, 試される勇気\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto, Revenge Lessons\",\"number\":181,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team 7 stops in a town for some rest, where they encounter a man named Tsukado who is out to avenge the death of his relative.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト, 仇討ち指南塾\"},{\"title\":\"Gaara \\\"Bonds\\\"\",\"number\":182,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara, recalling a past mission carried out with the Leaf’s Team 7, points out that the Leaf Village has Naruto with them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"我愛羅『絆』\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto Outbreak\",\"number\":183,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto visits Sakura, who is caring for Tsunade. Sakura recalls an incident that took place three years before, in which she collapsed from symptoms that resembled a disease caused by a mysterious virus.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト・アウトブレイク\"},{\"title\":\"Set Out! Team Tenten\",\"number\":184,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tenten and Neji head for the Leaf Ninja Tool Research Lab to procure ninja tools necessary for rebuilding the Leaf Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"出撃! テンテン班\"},{\"title\":\"Animal District\",\"number\":185,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Condor, the ostrich previously captured by Team 7, now lives in a forest with baby ostriches. Since his last escape, Condor has trained himself to become a ninja ostrich.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アニマル番外地\"},{\"title\":\"Ah, Medicinal Pill of Youth\",\"number\":186,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After accidentally finishing off Lee’s last special youth drink, Naruto asks Guy to make more, only to learn one of its key ingredients, the Jofuku Flower, is out of stock. Naruto is determined to get the Jofuku Flower for Lee’s sake.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ああ, 青春の漢方丸\"},{\"title\":\"Gutsy Master and Student - The Training\",\"number\":187,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya takes Naruto to a village in the hopes of teaching him how to counter the Sharingan’s genjutsu attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ド根性師弟修業編\"},{\"title\":\"Record of the Ninja Gutsy Master and Student\",\"number\":188,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Jiraiya attempt to save a village from Kandachi, a former right-hand man to Hanzo of the Hidden Rain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ド根性師弟忍風録\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Paw Encyclopedia\",\"number\":189,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Granny Cat requests that Sasuke and Team 7 collect the last cat paw print necessary to complete the “Paw Encyclopedia.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケの肉球大全\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto and the Old Soldier\",\"number\":190,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is assigned to a team led by jonin Hayama to patrol the north border of the Leaf Village. One of his teammates is Kosuke, an old man who has been a genin for over fifty years, earning him the title “Eternal Genin.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトと老兵\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi Love Song\",\"number\":191,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A beautiful kunoichi spy named Hanare is captured for attempting to gather intel on the Hidden Leaf.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシ恋歌\"},{\"title\":\"Neji Chronicles\",\"number\":192,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During the Chunin Exam, Neji rests in the medical room, having lost to Naruto. Just as Tenten comes in to check up on him, they see the Leaf Village attacked by Orochimaru and his men.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ネジ外伝\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Who Died Twice\",\"number\":193,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On his way home Naruto comes across a rock pasted with a peculiar talisman, which he tears off without thinking. That night, Naruto is surprised to find an amnesic ghost standing near his bed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二度死んだ男\"},{\"title\":\"The Worst Three-Legged Race\",\"number\":194,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team 7 is after a group of thieves who have stolen the precious Golden Statue from the Feudal Lord`s sister.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最悪の二人三脚\"},{\"title\":\"Cooperation, Team 10\",\"number\":195,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team 7 and Team 10 are assigned to help a village that is troubled by bandits.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"連携, 第十班\"},{\"title\":\"Rush Into the Darkness\",\"number\":196,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke’s jealousy of Naruto’s tremendous growth in strength causes friction between the two. Tsunade decides to give them some time apart by assigning them separate missions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇への疾走\"},{\"title\":\"The Sixth Hokage Danzo\",\"number\":197,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Samui of the Hidden Cloud arrive at the Leaf Village and are shocked to find it in ruins. Nonetheless, they carry out their orders to deliver the Raikage’s official letter to the Hokage, when Danzo appears and announces that he is the new Hokage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"六代目火影ダンゾウ\"},{\"title\":\"Five Kage Summit`s Eve\",\"number\":198,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Karui and Omoi of the Hidden Cloud press Naruto to give information regarding Sasuke. Naruto realizes they’re motivated by wanting to save their captured master, but decides he cannot sell out his friend. Instead, Naruto offers himself as a punching bag for Karui and Omoi to abuse to their hearts’ content.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五影会談前夜\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the Five Kage\",\"number\":199,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kage from each nation set out to attend the Five Kage Summit.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五影登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Appeal\",\"number\":200,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To prevent the cycle of hatred bound to occur should Sasuke be killed, Naruto goes to the Raikage and begs him to forgive Sasuke, but the Raikage quickly dismisses the request.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトの嘆願\"},{\"title\":\"A Bitter Decision\",\"number\":201,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mifune calls for the formation of the Allied Shinobi Forces to counter the Akatsuki and proposes the Hokage to lead them. Meanwhile, Sai reveals Naruto’s actions to Sakura.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"苦渋の決断\"},{\"title\":\"Racing Lightning\",\"number\":202,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara, who has taken an interest in Naruto, makes a sudden appearance before Naruto and reveals the truth behind Itachi’s actions.  Meanwhile, the samurai learn of Sasuke and his team Taka’s entry into the Land of Iron, and battle ensues between the two groups.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"疾走る雷\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Ninja Way\",\"number\":203,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The truth behind Itachi’s actions leaves Naruto, Kakashi, and Yamato in shock. Madara then goes on to reveal the eternal hate stemming from as far back as the rivalry between the two sons of the legendary Sage of the Sixth Paths and its relation to the Uchiha clan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケの忍道\"},{\"title\":\"The Five Kage`s Power\",\"number\":204,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having blocked the combined attacks of Gaara, Temari, Kankuro, and Darui with his Susano’o, Sasuke goes after Danzo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五影の実力\"},{\"title\":\"Declaration of War\",\"number\":205,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The four Kage are startled by the sudden appearance of Madara Uchiha. Having sent Sasuke away to safety using the Transportation Technique, Madara unveils to the Kage his “Project Tsuki no Me.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"宣戦布告\"},{\"title\":\"Sakura`s Feelings\",\"number\":206,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Kage respond to Madara’s declaration of war by forming the Allied Shinobi Forces, with the Raikage as their leader.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サクラの想い\"},{\"title\":\"A Tailed Beast vs. A Tailed Beast With no Tail\",\"number\":207,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Killer Bee engages in a deadly battle against Kisame, who has come to capture the Eight-Tails.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"尾獣VS尾のない尾獣\"},{\"title\":\"As a Friend\",\"number\":208,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto learns from Sai that Sakura intends to kill Sasuke with her own hands. The Sand arrives to brief the Leaf ninja about what happened at the Five Kage Summit.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"親友[とも]として\"},{\"title\":\"Danzo`s Right Arm\",\"number\":209,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi decides to go after Sakura to stop her, while Yamato and Naruto are ordered to return to the Leaf Village. Meanwhile, Sasuke confronts Danzo after seeing the many Sharingan embedded in his enemy’s right arm.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ダンゾウの右腕\"},{\"title\":\"The Forbidden Ocular Jutsu\",\"number\":210,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Danzo’s uncanny jutsu prevents Sasuke from landing a clean hit on his enemy. As Karin attempts to analyze Danzo’s jutsu, Madara recognizes it as Izanagi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁じられた瞳術[どうじゅつ]\"},{\"title\":\"Shimura Danzou\",\"number\":211,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Danzo believes he’s won the battle against Sasuke. Little does he realize, Sasuke placed him under genjutsu before they last exchanged blows.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"志村ダンゾウ\"},{\"title\":\"Sakura`s Resolve\",\"number\":212,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having tracked down Sasuke’s whereabouts with Kiba’s nose, Sakura attempts to put her allies to sleep and carry out the task of killing Sasuke herself.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サクラの覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"Lost Bonds\",\"number\":213,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Memories from his childhood course through Naruto’s mind as he rests to recover from his hyperventilation.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失われた絆\"},{\"title\":\"The Burden I Should Bear\",\"number\":214,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura tells Sasuke that she wishes to desert the village and join him. A skeptical Sasuke tells Sakura he will believe her if she can finish off Karin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"背負うべき重荷\"},{\"title\":\"The Fated Two\",\"number\":215,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto reproaches Sasuke for attempting to kill Sakura. Then Sasuke reveals that he killed Danzo with his own hands. He goes on to declare his intent to purify the Uchiha clan’s name by annihilating the Hidden Leaf.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"宿命のふたり\"},{\"title\":\"Top-Class Shinobi\",\"number\":216,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Years ago at the Final Valley, Sasuke told Naruto about high-level shinobi being able to understand one another just by trading blows. Having become a high-level shinobi, Naruto is now able to understand Sasuke’s heart.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一流の忍\"},{\"title\":\"Infiltrator\",\"number\":217,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Killer Bee returns to the Hidden Cloud Village to the delight of Omoi and Karui. He has brought Kisame’s sword, Samehada, with him. Bee believes the sword has taken a liking to him but is unaware that this is all just part of the Akatsuki’s plan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入者\"},{\"title\":\"Nations on the Move\",\"number\":218,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The formation of the Allied Shinobi Forces is ratified by the Feudal Lords of the Five Great Nations. Each Kage returns to their village to prepare for the coming war\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出す大国\"},{\"title\":\"The Hokage Kakashi Hatake\",\"number\":219,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto gathers his friends and tells them that he will defeat Sasuke alone. Meanwhile, the Elders of the Leaf officially nominate Kakashi to become the next Hokage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火影はたけカカシ\"},{\"title\":\"The Great Toad`s Prediction\",\"number\":220,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In Mount Myoboku, Gerotora, Fukasaku, and the Great Lord Elder are debating whether to give Naruto the key to the Tetragram Seal left behind by Jiraiya, an act that could unleash the Nine Tails.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大ガマの予言\"},{\"title\":\"Storage\",\"number\":221,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At Mount Myoboku, Naruto prepares to store Gerotora within himself, but hesitates as it also holds the potential risk of unleashing the Nine Tails on the world.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"蔵人り\"},{\"title\":\"The Five Kage`s Decision\",\"number\":222,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The denizens of the Leaf Village ready themselves for the coming of the Fourth Great Ninja War.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五影[ごかげ]の決断\"},{\"title\":\"The Young Man and the Ocean\",\"number\":223,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade sends out Naruto under the guise of a top-secret mission to keep him hidden away from the Akatsuki. Unfortunately, Naruto, Yamato, Gai, and Aoba are stuck at the pier due to a report of a monster attacking ships.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"青年と海\"},{\"title\":\"The Ninja of Benisu\",\"number\":224,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During their voyage, Naruto, Yamato, Gai, and Aoba stop at an island to recover from severe seasickness. There, they unexpectedly meet up with Sakura, Ino, and Choji, who are on an assignment to gather medical herbs for Tsunade.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"紅州の商忍\"},{\"title\":\"The Cursed Ghost Ship\",\"number\":225,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto`s ship is stranded at sea due to heavy fog, when another ship suddenly appears.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呪われた幽霊船\"},{\"title\":\"Battleship Island\",\"number\":226,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pirates living on an island resembling a battleship open fire on Naruto’s ship.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦艦の島\"},{\"title\":\"Island of Oblivion\",\"number\":227,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Going after Guy, who was whisked away by a giant bird, Naruto, Yamato, and Aoba arrive on an island where they spot a young woman.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忘却の島\"},{\"title\":\"Fight, Rock Lee\",\"number\":228,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Guy recalls the time when he and Lee celebrated Lee learning the Hidden Lotus technique.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闘えロックリー\"},{\"title\":\"Eat or Die! Mushrooms from Hell!\",\"number\":229,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Making a stop at a nearby port to stock up on supplies, Naruto buys a rare mushroom from a vegetable merchant. But soon after they set sail for their next destination, Naruto and the other crewmembers find their ship infested with poisonous mushrooms.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"食うか食われるか!踊るキノコ地獄\"},{\"title\":\"Counterattack From the Shadows\",\"number\":230,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto’s Shadow Clones turn against their master after feeling mistreated and overworked.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"影の逆襲\"},{\"title\":\"The Closed Sea Route\",\"number\":231,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As he prepares for the coming war, Shikamaru begins to feel the pressure of shouldering the lives of his friends. To help ease his mind, Shikaku sends his son on a mission to Mokuzu Island where Shikamaru meets up with Naruto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"閉ざされた航路\"},{\"title\":\"The Girls` Get-Together\",\"number\":232,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hinata’s father Hiashi summons the Hyuga clan to discuss the role they will be playing in the upcoming Fourth Great Ninja War.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉の女子会\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Imposter\",\"number\":233,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others encounter a thief who claims that he is Naruto Uzumaki of the Hidden Leaf. The real Naruto easily takes care of the imposter and hands him over to a ninja who was after the thief.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"参上, 偽?ナルト\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Favorite Pupil\",\"number\":234,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Konohamaru is eager to fight alongside his senior ninja in the coming war, but his young age prevents him from being assigned to the battlefield.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトの愛弟子\"},{\"title\":\"The Kunoichi of Nadeshiko Village\",\"number\":235,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto meets two kunoichi ninja named Shizuka and Tokiwa from the Nadeshiko village who are seeking the student of Jiraiya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"撫子のくノ一\"},{\"title\":\