Jinin Akebino.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兜割! 通草野餌人\"},{\"title\":\"User of the Scorch Style: Pakura of the Sand!\",\"number\":285,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A group of Allied Shinobi, including Omoi and Maki of the Sand, battle against several reanimated enemies. Maki recognizes one of them as Pakura, her former master who was a Sand Village hero.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"灼遁使い! 砂隠れのパクラ\"},{\"title\":\"Things You Can`t Get Back\",\"number\":286,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Still coping with the loss of her loved ones, Tsunade indulges in gambling and drinking. Around the same time, the Raikage Ay and his men are on a mission to steal a scroll from a certain village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"取り戻せないもの\"},{\"title\":\"One Worth Betting On\",\"number\":287,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Raikage Ay and his team suffer critical injuries during an enemy attack. Unwilling to sacrifice any more of his men, Ay seeks medical help from Tsunade, who just happens to be in the area.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"賭けるに値する者\"},{\"title\":\"Danger: Jinpachi and Kushimaru!\",\"number\":288,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi races to the scene where the Seven Ninja Swordsmen Kushimaru Kuriarare and Jinpachi Munashi were last sighted. Enraged by the carnage they’ve left behind, Kakashi teams up with Might Guy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"脅威, 甚八・串丸コンビ!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Lightning Blade: Ameyuri Ringo!\",\"number\":289,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Omoi’s unit is attacked by Ameyuri Ringo of the Seven Ninja Swordsmen and loses one of Omoi’s men. Omoi attempts to avenge his comrade, but Nurui orders everyone to retreat.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雷刀!! 林檎雨由利\"},{\"title\":\"Power - Episode 1\",\"number\":290,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his team are assigned a mission to identify and hunt down the perpetrator of the Tonika Village massacre. It’s been a while since Naruto has had a mission, and he’s pumped to take it on.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode1\"},{\"title\":\"Power - Episode 2\",\"number\":291,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While investigating the village near Tonika, Kabuto confronts Naruto. An epic battle erupts as Kabuto uses the forbidden Reanimation Jutsu against Naruto. In the meantime, Dokku and the five survivors lie low at the village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode2\"},{\"title\":\"Power - Episode 3\",\"number\":292,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sakura decide to stay at Shiseru’s house overnight to help watch over the survivors. Although the children cry and miss their deceased parents, Dokku and Shiseru try hard to bring everyone together as a new family.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode3\"},{\"title\":\"Power - Episode 4\",\"number\":293,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A clone possessing the Nine Tails’ chakra emerges from Naruto’s body. Seeking more power, the clone goes on a rampage, destroying everything in its path.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode4\"},{\"title\":\"Power - Episode 5\",\"number\":294,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After their defeat by the Nine Tails’ clone, Naruto and Dokku are taken captive by Kabuto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode5\"},{\"title\":\"Power: Final Episode\",\"number\":295,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The legendary Ama no Hoko imbues the Nine Tails’ clone with enough power to destroy the world. Naruto is overcome by its immense power and lies unconscious.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力 episode Final\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto Enters the Battle!\",\"number\":296,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto makes his entrance onto the battlefield and uses his sensory powers to detect and destroy the transformed White Zetsu clones. During the battle, Shikaku updates Naruto with what they currently know on Madara.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト, 参戦!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Father`s Hope, a Mother`s Love\",\"number\":297,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara leads the Fourth Company into battle against the previous Kage, including his father, the late Fourth Kazekage. The Fourth Kazekage attacks Gaara in order to determine if his son is truly worthy to be the current Kazekage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父の想い, 母の愛\"},{\"title\":\"Contact! Naruto vs. Itachi\",\"number\":298,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Killer Bee engage in battle against the reanimated Itachi Uchiha and Nagato. Itachi learns from Naruto that Sasuke has chosen the path of vengeance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ついに接触!! ナルトVSイタチ\"},{\"title\":\"The Ones Who Are Acknowledged\",\"number\":299,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi uses the ultimate genjutsu technique Koto Amatsukami to free himself from the Reanimation Jutsu. Itachi then joins Naruto and Killer Bee to fight Nagato, who is still under Kabuto’s control.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"認められし者\"},{\"title\":\"The Mizukage, the Giant Clam and the Mirage\",\"number\":300,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Fourth Company continue their fight against the reanimated Kage. Gaara and Ohnoki team up to hold off Second Tsuchikage Mu, while the remaining shinobi take on the Second Mizukage, who is willing to be sealed away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"水影と蜃と蜃気楼\"},{\"title\":\"Paradox\",\"number\":301,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Temari leads the attack on the Third Raikage using Wind Style, but even her strongest jutsu is not enough to penetrate the Raikage’s invincible armor.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"矛盾\"},{\"title\":\"Terror: The Steam Imp\",\"number\":302,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara and Ohnoki manage to overcome the Second Mizukage’s mirage attack. Having taken an interest in Gaara, the Second Mizukage decides to further test the young Kage’s skills.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖・蒸危暴威[ジョウキボーイ]\"},{\"title\":\"Ghosts from the Past\",\"number\":303,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru, Choji, Neji, and Kiba find themselves up against some familiar faces from the past. The Sound Ninja Four have been brought back by Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu, and they are ready to seek vengeance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"過去の亡霊\"},{\"title\":\"The Underworld Transfer Jutsu\",\"number\":304,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru, Neji, Choji, and Kiba succeed in defeating the Sound Ninja Four. But the enemy uses the Underworld Transfer Jutsu to trap the Leaf shinobi’s souls inside a barrier.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黄泉転身の術\"},{\"title\":\"The Vengeful\",\"number\":305,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Time is running out for the Leaf shinobi whose souls are trapped inside the Sound Four’s barrier. Ino and Shino exhaust their own chakra to keep their friends alive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復讐者\"},{\"title\":\"The Heart`s Eye\",\"number\":306,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hinata defends Neji from a White Zetsu clone while he’s recovering from an earlier fight. She then remembers the time Neji protected her the same way after she temporarily lost her sight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"心の目\"},{\"title\":\"Fade Into the Moonlight\",\"number\":307,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Three years ago, Leaf Anbu Yugao Uzuki lost her lover Hayate Gekko in battle. Unable to cope with his death, Yugao has since left the Anbu and joined the Medical Corps. Meanwhile, Kabuto has reanimated Hayate.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月光に消ゆ\"},{\"title\":\"Night of the Crescent Moon\",\"number\":308,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yugao is ordered by Sukui to track down the reanimated Hayate. Still shaken by her lover’s unexpected return as an enemy, Yugao manages to catch up to Hayate and his men.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三日月の夜\"},{\"title\":\"The A-Rank Mission: Food Fight\",\"number\":309,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto arrives to help a team of Allied Shinobi Forces led by Karui, who are struggling against a reanimated samurai. Naruto recognizes the samurai as Tatewaki, a man he met during a past mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"A級任務・御膳試合\"},{\"title\":\"The Fallen Castle\",\"number\":310,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Leaf Shinobi succeed in bringing young lord Shu into custody, placing a disguised Naruto as his double. But Tatewaki soon uncovers Naruto’s identity and surrounds the intruder with his men.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"落城\"},{\"title\":\"Prologue of Road to Ninja\",\"number\":311,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara is prepping his new jutsu Limited Tsukuyomi, choosing Naruto as his test subject. Meanwhile, Naruto is spending his day off alone in his room. Thinking that Naruto is lonely, Lee suggests they all go to the bathhouse .\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"PROLOGUE OF ROAD TO NINJA\"},{\"title\":\"The Old Master and the Dragon`s Eye\",\"number\":312,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Might Guy arrives on the battlefield to stop a Reanimated Shinobi who he recognizes as Master Chen, the legendary Taijutsu User from the Third Great Ninja War.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"老人と龍の目\"},{\"title\":\"Rain Followed by Snow, With Some Lightning\",\"number\":313,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A reanimated boy who can control weather appears before Team Ino-Shika-Cho, Sakura, and Kiba, who are all fighting in different locations. To their surprise, the boy seems to know them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雨のち雪, ときどき雷\"},{\"title\":\"The Sad Sun Shower\",\"number\":314,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The weather-controlling enemy is revealed to be Yota, a boy who came to the Leaf Village years ago and befriended the local kids, including Naruto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲しい天気雨\"},{\"title\":\"Lingering Snow\",\"number\":315,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others finally regain their lost memories regarding Yota. Years ago, the Leaf Village kids came to befriend Yota, but the adults believed the young boy was a spy and took him away for questioning.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"名残雪\"},{\"title\":\"The Reanimated Allied Forces!\",\"number\":316,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto reanimates an army of unknown shinobi led by Danzo’s former bodyguard Torune to retrieve the ones he lost to the Allied Forces. But aside from Torune, the reanimated shinobi are all weak and are quickly sealed away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"穢土転生連合軍!!\"},{\"title\":\"Shino vs. Torune!\",\"number\":317,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During their battle against the White Zetsu, Shino’s beetles detect the presence of another enemy. Leaving the fight to Kiba and the others, Shino goes to investigate and finds Torune preparing to unleash his forbidden jutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シノVSトルネ!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Hole in the Heart: The Other Jinchuriki\",\"number\":318,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto reanimates Fukai to attack Killer Bee and Motoi. Fukai warns Killer Bee to escape before being taken over by Kabuto. To everyone’s surprise, Fukai releases Eight Tails’ chakra and enters Tailed Beast State.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"心の穴・もう一人の人柱力\"},{\"title\":\"The Soul Living Inside the Puppet\",\"number\":319,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A reanimated Granny Chiyo attacks Kankuro and Mifune’s team. Kankuro fights back by using the human puppet of Sasori. The sight of Sasori causes Granny Chiyo to recall the painful memories that led her grandson to create his human puppets.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"傀儡に宿る魂\"},{\"title\":\"Run, Omoi\",\"number\":320,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Allied Forces receive a report that Omoi has deserted his post, much to the Raikage’s shock. It is soon revealed that Omoi has defied orders to go save the Thundercloud Unit.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"走れオモイ\"},{\"title\":\"Reinforcements Arrive\",\"number\":321,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"White Zetsu’s ability to mimic people’s appearances has wrought confusion and distrust within the Allied Shinobi Forces. Naruto arrives to assist, and using his sensory powers, he identifies all the disguised White Zetsu clones, changing the tide of the battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"増援到着\"},{\"title\":\"Madara Uchiha\",\"number\":322,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The reanimated shinobi appearing before Gaara and Ohnoki is revealed to be none other than Madara Uchiha himself…which raises the question of who the masked man claiming to be Madara really is.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うちはマダラ\"},{\"title\":\"The Five Kage Assemble\",\"number\":323,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The power of the reanimated Madara Uchiha far exceeds what the Allied Forces expected. Despite the difference in power, the Third Tsuchikage, Ohnoki, along with Naruto and Gaara, refuses to give up.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五影集結...!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Unbreakable Mask and the Shattered Bubble\",\"number\":324,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Killer Bee face off against the masked man originally thought to be Madara Uchiha, in addition to the reanimated Jinchuriki. Naruto is shocked when he recognizes one of the Jinchuriki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"割れない仮面・割れたシャボン玉\"},{\"title\":\"Jinchuriki vs. Jinchuriki!\",\"number\":325,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Killer Bee take on the six Reanimated Jinchuriki, who’ve been equipped with the Rinnegan. Using his past experience from fighting the Six Paths of Pain, Naruto devises a plan to stop the Jinchuriki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"人柱力VS人柱力!!\"},{\"title\":\"Four Tails, the King of Sage Monkeys\",\"number\":326,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi and Guy arrive in the nick of time to back up Naruto and Killer Bee. The fight intensifies even further when three out of the six Reanimated Jinchuriki enter Tailed Beast State, forcing Naruto and the others to throw in everything they’ve got.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"四尾・仙猿の王\"},{\"title\":\"Kyuubi\",\"number\":327,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto finds himself inside Four Tails’ inner world, where he promises to free Four Tails from Madara’s control. Listening in on their conversation, Nine Tails recalls all the time he has spent sealed inside Naruto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"九尾\"},{\"title\":\"Kurama\",\"number\":328,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"For years, Naruto was the target of Nine Tails’ undying hatred. But their time together has made Nine Tails understand Naruto more than anyone. As Naruto continues to try and free Four Tails from Madara’s control, Nine Tails begins to undergo a change.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"九喇嘛\"},{\"title\":\"Two-Man Team\",\"number\":329,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto uses up the last of his chakra trying to free the Tailed Beasts from Madara’s control. When all seems lost, the Nine Tails finally acknowledges Naruto as its jinchuriki and offers its help.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ツーマンセル\"},{\"title\":\"The Promise of Victory\",\"number\":330,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The tide of battle is slowly shifting in the Allied Forces` favor, but many are uncertain that they really stand a chance against Madara Uchiha. To help boost their spirits, Shikaku orders Inoichi to send out a message to every member of the forces.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"勝利への予言\"},{\"title\":\"Eyes That See in the Dark\",\"number\":331,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Suigetsu and Jugo’s search for Sasuke leads them to one of Orochimaru’s old hideouts where they come across his research data, which could tip the outcome of the Fourth Great War. Meanwhile, Sasuke finally sets out to settle his score with Naruto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇を見る眼\"},{\"title\":\"The Will of Stone\",\"number\":332,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Five Kage are outmatched by the real Madara Uchiha’s devastating attacks. Just when Third Tsuchikage Ohnoki is about to give up, he remembers the words of the previous Tsuchikage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石の意志\"},{\"title\":\"The Risks of the Reanimation Jutsu\",\"number\":333,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade leaves her post as Medic Ninja to join the other Kage in fighting Madara. Meanwhile, Sasuke goes after Itachi and learns that his brother intends on stopping Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"穢土転生のリスク\"},{\"title\":\"Sibling Tag Team\",\"number\":334,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke and Itachi team up to stop Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu. But Kabuto’s new ability to use Nature Energy has made him a difficult target for the brothers to land their Susano’o attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兄弟, 共闘[タッグ]!!\"},{\"title\":\"To Each Their Own Leaf\",\"number\":335,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto attempts to bring Sasuke over to his side by pointing out that they both are fighting for the same goal: to bring down the Leaf Village. But Sasuke quickly rejects him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"互いの木ノ葉\"},{\"title\":\"Kabuto Yakushi\",\"number\":336,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto’s past is finally revealed. As child, a woman named Nonou raised Kabuto at an orphanage in the Leaf Village. One day, Danzo and Orochimaru visit the orphanage to provide financial aid under the condition that Nonou work as their spy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"薬師カブト\"},{\"title\":\"The Izanami Activated\",\"number\":337,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kabuto’s quest to discover his true identity has led him over the years to collect, analyze, and use the abilities of all shinobi within him, including Kimimaro, the Sound Four and Orochimaru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"発動・イザナミ\"},{\"title\":\"Izanagi and Izanami\",\"number\":338,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi activates the Visual Jutsu Izanami to trap Kabuto’s mind. Itachi then explains to Sasuke how Izanami was originally developed to keep the Uchiha from abusing the power of Izanagi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イザナギとイザナミ\"},{\"title\":\"I Will Love You Always\",\"number\":339,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Five Kage watch helplessly as Madara activates his Perfect Susano’o to destroy them. Meanwhile, Itachi succeeds in undoing Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu. Before fading away, Itachi reveals to Sasuke the truth behind the Uchiha massacre.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お前をずっと愛している\"},{\"title\":\"Reanimation Jutsu: Release!\",\"number\":340,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thanks to Itachi, the Reanimation Jutsu is released, and all the Reanimated Shinobi are returned to their resting places. But to everyone’s surprise, the real Madara still remains!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"穢土転生・解\"},{\"title\":\"Orochimaru`s Return\",\"number\":341,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Suigetsu and Jugo finally catch up to Sasuke. In order to learn the truth behind the Leaf’s actions, Sasuke decides to resurrect the one man who can help him find the answer—Orochimaru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復活!! 大蛇丸\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret of the Transportation Technique\",\"number\":342,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having absorbed the chakras of all nine Tailed Beasts, the Gedo Statue begins its transformation into Ten Tails. Naruto, Killer Bee, Kakashi, and Guy try to destroy the Gedo Statue but are stopped by the masked man who is able to phase through all of their attacks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"時空間忍術の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Who Are You?\",\"number\":343,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi is disturbed to discover a strange connection between the masked man’s Transportation Technique and his own Kamui Jutsu. Naruto throws everything he’s got against the masked man and succeeds in shattering his mask. The identity of the masked man is finally revealed!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"てめーは誰だ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Obito and Madara\",\"number\":344,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The identity of the masked man is revealed to be Kakashi’s old friend Obito, previously believed to have died in the battle of Kannabi Bridge. Naruto and the others are further shocked when they learn that Obito has been working with Madara Uchiha for years to orchestrate Project Tsuki no Me.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オビトとマダラ\"},{\"title\":\"I`m in Hell\",\"number\":345,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the Battle of Kannabi Bridge, Obito finds himself inside the hidden lair of Madara Uchiha, who saved the young shinobi’s life. There, Obito works to rehabilitate his injured body in the hopes of being reunited with Kakashi and Rin. But when Obito learns that they are in danger, he leaves Madara’s hideout to go help his friends and is forced to witness something he does not wish to see…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オレは地獄に居る\"},{\"title\":\"World of Dreams\",\"number\":346,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Obito watches in disbelief as Kakashi kills Rin. Unable to accept the harsh reality, Obito decides to carry out Madara’s dream so that he can create an ideal world where Rin still exists. Taking on the name Madara Uchiha, Obito sets out to find Nagato, who possesses the Rinnegan necessary to accomplish project Tsuki-no-me.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夢の世界\"},{\"title\":\"Creeping Shadow\",\"number\":347,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Years ago, Yahiko, Nagato, and Konan form the Akatsuki to realize their dream of bringing peace to the Hidden Rain. Starting out small, they gradually gain recognition and support from other shinobi, including Hanzo the Salamander. But Obito, disguised as Madara Uchiha, warns the three that their ideals will never be realized.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍び寄る影\"},{\"title\":\"The New Akatsuki\",\"number\":348,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Danzo deliberately misleads Hanzo, telling him that the Akatsuki are attempting to sabotage the peace talks between the Hidden Rain and Stone. Believing his story, Hanzo sets up a trap to crush the Akatsuki for the sake of his people.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新生・\\\"暁\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"A Mask That Hides the Heart\",\"number\":349,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the end of the Third Great Ninja War, the Leaf Village is divided over who should become the next Hokage. Minato Namikaze is soon appointed as the Fourth Hokage, much to the annoyance of Danzo and Orochimaru. Meanwhile, Kakashi is haunted by the deaths of Obito and Rin, causing him to lose focus on his missions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"心を隠す面\"},{\"title\":\"Minato`s Death\",\"number\":350,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi becomes part of the ANBU Black Ops, an elite team of shinobi who are under the direct command of the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze. Although he is highly regarded by his peers, Kakashi’s ruthless way of killing the enemy has earned him the nickname “Cold-blooded Kakashi.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ミナトの死\"},{\"title\":\"Hashirama`s Cells\",\"number\":351,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Foundation, Kakashi meets a boy who uses Wood Style, a jutsu that only First Hokage Hashirama was capable of using. Kakashi goes to Third Hokage Hiruzen’s library to seek answers and discovers records regarding Hashirama’s cells.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"柱間細胞\"},{\"title\":\"The Rogue Ninja Orochimaru\",\"number\":352,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru is forced to flee the Hidden Leaf after Third Hokage Hiruzen exposes his illegal experiments. Danzo, fearing that Orochimaru’s capture would lead to the exposure of his own involvement in the experiments, sends out one of his men to help the rogue ninja.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"抜け忍・大蛇丸\"},{\"title\":\"Orochimaru`s Test Subject\",\"number\":353,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While pursuing Orochimaru, Kakashi wanders into a village inhabited by the Iburi Clan, a group of people with the unique ability to turn into smoke. Kakashi is soon captured and learns that the villagers all serve under Orochimaru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大蛇丸の実験体\"},{\"title\":\"Their Own Paths\",\"number\":354,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yukimi leaves the village to see the outside world, taking “Tenzo” with her. Kakashi tries to convince the two to return so that he can set a trap to capture Orochimaru, who is after Yukimi’s blood. But Yamato, who has grown attached to Yukimi, abandons his original mission to protect his friend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"それぞれの道\"},{\"title\":\"The Targeted Sharingan\",\"number\":355,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Danzo orders Tenzo to kill Kakashi and take his Sharingan. Reluctant at first, Tenzo decides to carry out his orders after learning that the Leaf Shinobi has come to be known as “Kakashi the Friend Killer.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狙われた写輪眼\"},{\"title\":\"A Shinobi of the Leaf\",\"number\":356,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After being saved by the target he was ordered to kill, Tenzo realizes that the man known as “Kakashi the Friend Killer” is someone who values the lives of his comrades more than anyone. No longer wishing to kill Kakashi, Tenzo abandons the mission and returns to the Leaf Village, fully aware that his actions will stir up Danzo’s anger.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉の忍\"},{\"title\":\"An Uchiha ANBU\",\"number\":357,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi Uchiha is inducted into Kakashi’s unit as the youngest member of the ANBU Black Ops. Itachi’s father, Fugaku, is pleased, thinking this will grant the Uchiha access to exclusive, top-secret Leaf intel. But Danzo, who wants intel on the Uchiha, orders Itachi to betray his family and clan by acting as a double agent.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"暗部のうちは\"},{\"title\":\"Coup d`Etat\",\"number\":358,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Following the aftermath of the Nine-Tails incident, many on the Leaf Council voice suspicions that the Uchiha Clan were behind this tragedy.  The Uchiha are then placed under 24-hour surveillance by the ANBU, which causes further tensions to arise.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"クーデター\"},{\"title\":\"The Night of the Tragedy\",\"number\":359,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi visits the Uchiha District and notices that the community seems more antisocial than the last time he visited. Meanwhile Itachi finds concrete evidence regarding the Uchiha Clan’s coup against the Leaf. The fateful moment is fast approaching…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"惨劇の夜\"},{\"title\":\"Jonin Leader\",\"number\":360,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hiruzen relieves Kakashi of his ANBU duties and assigns him a new position as a Jonin Leader. Reflecting on his past mistakes, Kakashi decides to use the same test that Minato once used to measure one’s teamwork.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"担当上忍\"},{\"title\":\"Squad Seven\",\"number\":361,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hiruzen assigns Kakashi to be in charge of Naruto, Sasuke, and Sakura, three genin that bear a striking resemblance to the former Team Minato.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第七班\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi`s Resolve\",\"number\":362,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi desperately tries to reach out to Obito, but his words fall on deaf ears. Obito instead accuses Kakashi of being trash, which angers Naruto, forcing him to step in and defend his Sensei.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシの決意\"},{\"title\":\"The Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu\",\"number\":363,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The barrier is shattered, and Ten Tails appears! With unfathomable power in its attack, it sends shock waves through the air! Kurama takes the lead and tries to go on the offensive, but is helpless against Ten Tails` immense strength. Soon both Kurama and Gyuki exhaust their chakra and fade away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍連合軍の術!\"},{\"title\":\"The Ties That Bind\",\"number\":364,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Allied Shinobi Forces begin their onslaught against Obito and Madara. But Ten Tails suddenly transforms and hurls powerful Tailed Beast Bombs toward distant towns. One after the other, the Tailed Beast Bombs find their targets. The shinobi wonder why Ten Tails is aiming so far away as one of the bombs heads toward HQ!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"繋がれるもの\"},{\"title\":\"Those Who Dance in the Shadows\",\"number\":365,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is overcome with grief over Neji’s death, but Hinata`s words restore his fighting spirit. Shikaku outlines his final strategy before he dies, in which Nine Tails will send its chakra to increase everyone`s strength. United in their cause, Naruto and the shinobi set out to take on Ten Tails, determined that Neji and their comrades will not have died in vain!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍び舞う者たち\"},{\"title\":\"The All-Knowing\",\"number\":366,\"airDate\":\"2014-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke returns to the Hidden Leaf Village seeking answers, and standing before him are First Hokage Hashirama, Second Hokage Tobirama, Third Hokage Hiruzen, and Fourth Hokage Minato, all reanimated.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全てを知る者たち\"},{\"title\":\"Hashirama and Madara\",\"number\":367,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"Villages did not exist when Hashirama was a child. It was during this strife-filled time that he met Madara Uchiha.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"柱間とマダラ\"},{\"title\":\"Era of Warring States\",\"number\":368,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara and Hashirama eventually become the leaders of their respective clans. As the fighting rages on between the Senju and Uchiha, Hashirama approaches Madara about an alliance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦国時代\"},{\"title\":\"My True Dream\",\"number\":369,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Senju and Uchiha clans join together to build a shinobi village and fulfill their dreams.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"本当の夢\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Answer\",\"number\":370,\"airDate\":\"2014-07-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After listening to what Hashirama and the rest of the former Hokage have to say, Sasuke finally understands how the Leaf Village and its shinobi came to be.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケの答え\"},{\"title\":\"Hole\",\"number\":371,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The fighting rages between Naruto, who stands at the vanguard of the Allied Shinobi Forces, and the team of Madara and Obito.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"風穴\"},{\"title\":\"Something to Fill the Hole\",\"number\":372,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ten Tails is on the brink of its final transformation and begins to form a massive Tailed Beast Bomb.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"埋めるもの\"},{\"title\":\"Team 7 Assemble!\",\"number\":373,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team 7 is finally reunited when Naruto, Sakura and Sasuke join forces.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"第七班, 集結!!\"},{\"title\":\"The New Three-Way Deadlock\",\"number\":374,\"airDate\":\"2014-08-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Bearing a close resemblance to the Legendary Sannin, Naruto, Sakura and Sasuke make a stunning arrival on the battlefield with each of their summonings.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たなる三竦み\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi vs. Obito\",\"number\":375,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi holds on to the hope that Obito can return to being the young man that he remembers. But Obito has abandoned the present as well as the memories of his friends and will not try to stop the Infinite Tsukuyomi. Realizing that nothing more can be done, Kakashi comes to a decision to protect the world, while his former friend is determined to end it!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カカシVSオビト\"},{\"title\":\"The Directive to Take the Nine Tails\",\"number\":376,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Part 1 of a special two-part extra edition! The townspeople are going about their daily business on the streets of the Leaf Village when someone suddenly appears and starts sending them flying!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"九尾強奪指令\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto vs. Mecha Naruto\",\"number\":377,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Part 2 of a special two-part extra edition! The townspeople are going about their daily business on the streets of the Leaf Village when someone suddenly appears and starts sending them flying!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト対メカナルト\"},{\"title\":\"The Ten Tails Jinchuuriki\",\"number\":378,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Obito completely absorbs the giant Ten Tails, undergoes a transformation and becomes the Ten Tails` Jinchuriki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"十尾の人柱力\"},{\"title\":\"An Opening\",\"number\":379,\"airDate\":\"2014-09-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Obito has gained complete control over his power as the Ten Tails Jinchuriki. His powerful, cold-blooded attacks force Naruto and his friends into a corner\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"突破口\"},{\"title\":\"The Day Naruto Was Born\",\"number\":380,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Minato is filled with regret during his confrontation with Obito. He thinks if only he had recognized Obito as the Masked Man during the assault on the Hidden Leaf Village, he could have stopped the attack, and maybe Kushina would not have died. The next day is the anniversary of Minato`s and Kushina`s deaths. Obito taunts Minato as a weak shinobi and seals every shinobi inside a barrier in order to destroy them all!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトが生まれた日\"},{\"title\":\"The Divine Tree\",\"number\":381,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Minato combine their powers to perform a Sage Jutsu attack on Obito.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"神樹\"},{\"title\":\"A Shinobi`s Dream\",\"number\":382,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Ten Tails morphs into its final form, \\\"The Divine Tree,\\\" and attacks the shinobi, absorbing their chakra one after another.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍の夢\"},{\"title\":\"Pursuing Hope\",\"number\":383,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto`s past, thoughts, and feelings flow into the consciousness of every shinobi, unifying their hearts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"希望[さき]を追う\"},{\"title\":\"A Heart Filled with Comrades\",\"number\":384,\"airDate\":\"2014-10-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke size up Obito as the final battle looms. Working in sync, Naruto and Sasuke prepare to attack in the same way Madara once did, bedecking Kurama in the robes of Susano`o.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仲間で満ちた心\"},{\"title\":\"Obito Uchiha\",\"number\":385,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto objects to Obito’s claim that he is the second Sage of Six Paths and declares that he is Obito Uchiha.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うちはオビト\"},{\"title\":\"I`m Always Watching\",\"number\":386,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pressed by Naruto, Obito remembers the time he, Kakashi, and Rin teamed up for the Chunin Exam and when he promised Rin that he would become Hokage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ちゃんと見てる\"},{\"title\":\"The Promise That Was Kept\",\"number\":387,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto`s power of persuasion moves Obito`s heart. Due to the influence of the Ten Tails, visions of himself and Rin from the past appear in the inner realm and play havoc with Obito’s emotions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"守られた約束\"},{\"title\":\"My First Friend\",\"number\":388,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"All the Tailed Beasts are freed, and old friends Kakashi and Obito come face to face with each other. What will Obito`s response be? Meanwhile, the Tailed Beasts and the Allied Shinobi Forces shift their focus onto their greatest foe, Madara Uchiha. Gaara is reunited with his former Tailed Beast, Shukaku. When Gaara asks Shukaku to lend his power to seal Madara, he refuses. Will their history of animosity prevent them from working together?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最初の友\"},{\"title\":\"The Adored Elder Sister\",\"number\":389,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hanabi adores her sister Hinata, who struggles to become a worthy successor to the Hyuga Clan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"憧れの姉さま\"},{\"title\":\"Hanabi`s Decision\",\"number\":390,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Hinata is labeled unfit as a successor, Hanabi`s heart becomes bound to her destiny.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ハナビの決意\"},{\"title\":\"Madara Uchiha Arises\",\"number\":391,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the Allied Shinobi Forces successfully extract the Tailed Beasts from Obito. Only Madara remains, and Naruto heads out to tackle this foe.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うちはマダラ, 立つ\"},{\"title\":\"The Hidden Heart\",\"number\":392,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With his newly revived strength, Madara doesn`t give in against the nine Tailed Beasts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏の心\"},{\"title\":\"A True Ending\",\"number\":393,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite all efforts, Kurama is extracted from Naruto, and ultimately, all the Tailed Beasts are imprisoned inside the Gedo Statue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"本当の終わり\"},{\"title\":\"The New Chuunin Exams\",\"number\":394,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The story travels back to the time after Sasuke`s defection from the Leaf and before Naruto`s return from his two-year training journey with Jiraiya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たなる中忍試験\"},{\"title\":\"The Chunin Exams Begin!\",\"number\":395,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Hidden Leaf begin preparing for the Chunin Exams. Ino and Choji ask Sakura to join their three-man team as a stand-in for Shikamaru, who is already a chunin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"中忍試験, 開始!\"},{\"title\":\"The Three Questions\",\"number\":396,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Chunin Exams finally begin and the proctor for Round One is none other than Shikamaru! The first exam is a written test.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三つの問題\"},{\"title\":\"One Worthy as a Leader\",\"number\":397,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The genin are unable to figure out the answer and start to panic. Neji announces to everyone in the room that he will tell them how to answer the question.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"リーダーに相応しい者\"},{\"title\":\"The Night Before the Second Exam\",\"number\":398,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On the night before the Second Exam, the entrants gather in the cafeteria, and a brawl breaks out. While the Hidden Leaf stand by helpless, the only one who can calm everyone down is Fuu from the Hidden Waterfall Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二次試験, 前夜\"},{\"title\":\"Demon Desert Survival\",\"number\":399,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Second Exam finally begins! To pass this stage, each team must take possession of both the Heaven and Earth scrolls and make it to the designated site in the center of the Demon Desert within 72 hours.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魔の砂漠のサバイバル\"},{\"title\":\"As a Taijutsu User\",\"number\":400,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Noting the similarities of their circumstances, Lee is outraged at the ones who hurt and belittled Shira and sets out in pursuit!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"体術使いとして...\"},{\"title\":\"The Ultimate\",\"number\":401,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lee challenges Shira to a battle between taijutsu users!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"極めし者\"},{\"title\":\"Escape vs. Pursuit\",\"number\":402,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kiba and his team are in pursuit of Hidden Grass Ninja who have stolen their scroll!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逃走VS追跡\"},{\"title\":\"Unwavering Gutsiness\",\"number\":403,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kiba and his team are in pursuit of Hidden Grass Ninja who have stolen their scroll!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"諦めないド根性\"},{\"title\":\"Tenten`s Troubles\",\"number\":404,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the team prepares for dinner, Tenten pulls out a scroll that contains all the ingredients for okonomiyaki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"テンテンの悩み\"},{\"title\":\"The Imprisoned Pair\",\"number\":405,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An ancient ruin in Demon Desert comes crumbling down during the battle for the scrolls.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"閉じ込められた二人\"},{\"title\":\"The Place Where I Belong\",\"number\":406,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ino, Sakura and Choji trudge across a desert under the blazing sun without any provisions. Ino and Sakura are arguing when a giant scorpion attacks and injures Sakura.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自分の居場所\"},{\"title\":\"The Yamanaka Clan: Secret Ninjutsu\",\"number\":407,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Ino and her team head toward an oasis, they are attacked by a team of Sand Shinobi comprised of Ameno, Shishio, and Kouji.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"山中一族・秘伝忍術\"},{\"title\":\"The Cursed Puppet\",\"number\":408,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura and her team continue their trek across the desert towards the goal. Their continuous battles have depleted Sakura`s chakra, so they stop to rest. Just then, they encounter a puppet manipulated by a rival team from the Sand and end up being discovered.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"呪いの人形\"},{\"title\":\"Their Backs\",\"number\":409,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ino and Choji fight to protect an immobilized Sakura although they have depleted most of their chakra due to the relentless fighting.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二人の背中\"},{\"title\":\"The Hidden Plot Set Into Motion\",\"number\":410,\"airDate\":\"2015-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sand Jonin Fugi sneaks into the Demon Desert and creates a massive sandstorm in order to assassinate Gaara, the Fifth Kazekage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出した陰謀\"},{\"title\":\"The Targeted Tailed Beast\",\"number\":411,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara heads out to rescue Matsuri and the others but is attacked by a mysterious priest who binds him with a Chakra Chain to capture his Tailed Beast.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狙われた尾獣\"},{\"title\":\"Neji`s Judgment\",\"number\":412,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Neji and the team come across Matsuri collapsed in the desert and find out that Gaara is in danger. Meanwhile, the chains of a mysterious priest bind Gaara and Foo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ネジの判断\"},{\"title\":\"Hopes Entrusted to the Future\",\"number\":413,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the Suna ninja search for their Kazekage, Gaara appears and orders for the continuation of the Chuunin Exams. He later communicates with Fugi via sand clone, making the latter realise that Houichi had failed in his assassination and had been defeated. As Gaara talks about his changes as a person and his hopes for the village, Fugi slowly realises that he had misjudged Gaara. Feeling ashamed of his actions in attempting to usurp Gaara, he commits seppuku. Meanwhile, Matsuri challenges Shira to a battle in order to see whether the will of the Kazekage has passed on to them, as his students. Shira then wins the battle, which prompts Matsuri to offer her team`s scroll; however, Team Shira declines due to them having the same scroll. Due to domestic complications within the village, Gaara announces the cancellation of the third stage of the exams. In order to assess the participants` performance in the exams, detailed reports of each team were sent to their villages, leaving the decisions of promotion to their respective Kage. After the exams, Team Ajisai is promoted to chuunin by Konan and is immediately assigned an S-rank mission, which results in Ajisai`s death. Her corpse is then delivered to a tower, where it is picked up by Konan. Meanwhile, Fuu and her team are ambushed by Hidan and Kakuzu. In Konoha, Tsunade promotes Kiba, Shino, Hinata, Sakura, Chouji, and Ino to chuunin, while declining the promotion of Team Komugi. Despite being unable to attain the two scrolls needed, Tenten and Lee are promoted to chuunin while Neji is given a double-promotion to jounin for his actions in saving the Kazekage. Elsewhere, Naruto and Jiraiya start to return back to Konoha after Naruto`s training.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"未来に託す思い\"},{\"title\":\"On the Brink of Death\",\"number\":414,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara transports Sakura and Naruto to the Fourth Hokage in order to have Yin-Kurama sealed into Naruto to save him. While being transported, Sakura attempts to heal Naruto. As the Nine-tails` chakra cloak disappears, Sakura discovers that her medical ninjutsu is unable to reverse the effects of the Yang-Kurama`s extraction and resorts to slicing open Naruto`s chest and manually pumping his heart. Meanwhile, Karin, distraught, goes after Sasuke to heal him. As Karin heads towards him, Tobi uses a miniature version of Hashirama`s Sage Art Wood Release: True Several Thousand Hands to stop her. Karin evades the attacks and uses chains to counter it. Tobi impales her with a wooden staff, which shoots out several branches. Karin, however, bites her arm and heals herself. Suigetsu then comes to Karin`s aid with his Water Gun: Two Guns technique. Juugo quickly follows and attempts to grab Tobi, who dodges but is unable to evade Orochimaru, who temporarily paralyses him with a cursed seal. Leaving Sasuke, Madara seals the Ten-Tails into himself and heads towards Obito, pausing for a moment to spit out the Benihisago and Kohaku no Jouhei from his mouth, which land on Lee and Guy, who are retreating with Tenten. When Karin senses ominous chakra where Sasuke is located, she rushes onwards. As Kakashi and Minato prepare to separate Obito and Black Zetsu, Yin-Kurama tells Minato to use his sensory mode. Gaara and Sakura then bring an unconscious Naruto and explain the situation to Minato. Minato tells Kakashi to deal with Obito, with Gaara volunteering to help him, while Minato prepares to seal Yin-Kurama into Naruto. However, Yin-Kurama is instead accidentally sealed into Black Zetsu, who intervenes in the process. Madara arrives at their location, berating Black Zetsu for the delay in retrieving the Rinnegan.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死の際\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Mangekyo\",\"number\":415,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now that its master is nearby, Black Zetsu declares that nobody can stop it from handing Madara the left Rinnegan and the Nine-Tails` Yin half, detaching itself from Obito`s body. As Kakashi and Gaara prepare to attack in order to give Naruto the means to survive the tailed beast`s extraction, Black Zetsu finds itself unable to leave Obito`s body, due to him not allowing it to. Obito questions Madara about who he himself is to the older Uchiha, with the jinchuuriki explaining how Obito – as a follower of Madara`s ideals – is Madara, he who wishes to cancel the world created by the Sage of the Six Paths and to create a new one through the Eye of the Moon Plan`s completion. Seemingly giving in to Madara`s words, Obito starts walking towards his ancestor, with Minato trying to attack Madara as Kakashi and Gaara try to stop Obito, only for Madara to effortlessly stop them. However, Obito doesn`t take Madara`s hand, but instead pierces him in the gut, claiming that his current self is the same as the one who wanted to become Hokage – recalling Naruto`s words in the process. Obito goes on to extract fragments of the One-Tail`s and the Eight-Tails` chakra, ordering Kakashi to teleport Naruto and Sakura to the other dimension. After Madara stops Obito from going there himself, Kakashi runs to Obito`s side, with his old comrade commenting on how Kakashi always looks down upon him, remembering the old times in Konohagakure.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二つの万華鏡\"},{\"title\":\"The Formation of Team Minato\",\"number\":416,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Obito overhears some shinobi complaining about completing missions with Kakashi and asks them about it. They tell him that Kakashi ignores his team-mates to complete missions no matter what, which conflicts with what Obito remembers Kakashi saying. They advise Obito to be wary of being assigned missions with Kakashi. Leaving the Academy, Obito shares his concerns with Rin. He then comes across Kakashi and tries to strike up a conversation with him, only for Kakashi to leave, telling him not to worry. Obito trains in the rain to catch up to Kakashi with Rin encouraging him in the background. Hiruzen asks Minato to teach Kakashi some humanity. Later, Rin berates Obito for being late to his own graduation ceremony and takes him inside to re-enact the graduation, giving him his certificate and telling him they were assigned to the same team. As Team Minato gathers for the first time, Minato applies the bell test. The team passes, and Minato informs them they`ll start with simple odd-job missions. Obito completes the missions with help from the elderly people he often aids, leading Minato to appreciate Obito`s kindness towards others. Due to Team Minato completing all available D-rank missions, they`re assigned a C-rank mission to escort a group of foreign shinobi carrying a missive. During the mission, Minato notices they`re being surrounded by enemies and orders Rin and Kakashi to go on ahead while he and Obito fall back to take care of the enemies. Obito and Minato engage in battle, with Minato having to save Obito from an attack. Another group of pursuers catch up to Rin and Kakashi`s group. Kakashi tells Rin to go on ahead while he stalls the enemies. One of theirs escortees, however, is hit, and falls down from a bridge into a river. Reaching near their destination, one of the escortees thanks Rin and Kakashi, but the other two reveal themselves as traitors and attack their fellow shinobi. Confident that Minato won`t be able to reach them in time, the traitors prepare to attack Rin and Kakashi.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結成・ミナト班\"},{\"title\":\"You`ll Be My Backup\",\"number\":417,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After being attacked by the two traitorous escortees, Minato and Obito arrive to back up Rin and Kakashi, but one of the two traitors escapes. The last escortee asks Minato to ensure that the scroll is real, as two of them were given scrolls. It is discovered that the scroll was a fake and the other escortee that fell had the other scroll. Obito immediately leaves to save the escortee and the others reluctantly follow. The escortee is found by enemy shinobi and is attacked; however, Obito and Kakashi arrive in time to save him. In the midst of the struggle, one of the pursuers grabs the scroll and they retreat. Kakashi leaves, claiming that completing the mission is his nindou. He goes after the group and attacks them. Obito sends a signal to Minato and tells him of Kakashi`s actions, who arrives just in time to save Kakashi and defeats the entire group. Team Minato returns the scroll and completes the mission. However, it is discovered that their team was sent as a decoy and that both scrolls were fake. Another group was charged with delivering the scroll to ensure it wouldn`t be stolen by enemy ninja. In the present, Madara launches two orbs at Obito and Kakashi to get the Rinnengan and the Yin-half of Kurama. Obito — with Kakashi`s help — transports himself to the other dimension. After convincing Sakura of his changed nature, Obito begins transferring the tailed beasts chakra to Naruto. In the real world, Guy arrives in the nick of time, saving Kakashi from Madara`s attack.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お前はバックアップだ\"},{\"title\":\"The Blue Beast vs Six Paths Madara\",\"number\":418,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Orochimaru and his team reach Sasuke, they realise that the unknown chakra signature is that of Kabuto. Since Kabuto has assimilated other people into himself, his chakra signature has become unknown, explaining why Karin could not identify the person near to Sasuke. Kabuto explains that he has decided to save Sasuke, after coming to realise who he was, thanks to the Izanami. Elsewhere, Guy releases the Gate of Wonder, which fails to damage Madara. Knowing that the Seventh Gate failed, Guy realises he must use the Gate of Death, which he knows will kill him. He remembers his time with his father, where he failed to graduate and decided to run 500 laps in order to enter the Academy as an alternate student. However, Guy is unable to finish running 500 laps and ends up passing out while the Third Hokage watches him from the window of the Academy. As Guy apologises to his father only to be scolded for not having faith, Guy becomes frustrated with his father being mocked and attacks two older ninja, only to end up being brutalised. He`s saved from further harm by Kakashi taking out the older ninja. After being saved by Kakashi, Guy watches him leaving with his father.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"碧き猛獣VS六道マダラ\"},{\"title\":\"Papa`s Youth\",\"number\":419,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A young Guy questions his father Might Duy on being optimistic despite criticisms from other people in the village. Duy reiterated that becoming strong is not about winning or defeating enemies, but protecting something precious. Guy continues his training and frequently sees Kakashi, which inspires him to challenge. However, Duy disagrees Guy`s proposition on challenging Kakashi and suggests to impose a self-rule. Guy follows and exerts his training just not to challenge Kakashi. After hardworking and perseverance, Guy finally graduates from the Academy and start accepting missions. Guy also notices his father taking lousy, low rank missions. Before departing on a mission, Guy overhears a conversation between his father and a jounin which seems to be dissatisfied with Duy`s performance. He also realises that his father`s seemingly under-performance is due to his training on the Eight Gates every night, which Duy passes and trains Guy on using the forbidden jutsu. During a mission, Guy`s team encounters the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist. Guy felt nervous from the swordsmen, realising the danger it poses until Duy appears and protects his son while using the Eight Gates. Shifting to present time, Guy finally activates the eighth gate. Encloaked in red vapor, Guy advances to Madara to unleash the Evening Elephant.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"パパの青春\"},{\"title\":\"The Eight Inner Gates Formation\",\"number\":420,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Guy begins his assault on Madara, using the Evening Elephant to attack, however the pain of using the Eight Gates Released Formation causes him to prematurely end the attack. Madara returns to the sky, excited over the opportunity to face a user of all Eight Gates. Kicking the air in order to match Madara`s flight, Guy prepares to use the Evening Elephant again. Minato tells the others they have to help Guy, and gives Lee one of his kunai. As Guy begins his second use of the Evening Elephant, Madara shields his attack with his Truth-Seeking Ball, countering with one of his own. Lee throws the kunai between Guy and the attack, so that Minato can use the Flying Thunder God Technique to send the orbs away. Gaara then lifts Kakashi close to Madara so that he can use Kamui to create an opening in Madara`s defence. Guy lands the final \\\"step\\\" of the Evening Elephant directly into Madara, pushing him through the back of his shield. Despite this devastating attack, Madara stands once again, stating his excitement hasn`t reached this level since fighting Hashirama. Elsewhere, Naruto wakes up and wonders if he has died. However a floating man tells him that he is not. Naruto questions the old man as to who he is, and is shocked to hear that the man is the Hagoromo Ootsutsuki, the Sage of Six Paths. Hagoromo tells Naruto of the cycle of reincarnation of the Sage`s sons, Indra and Asura, and tells Naruto of the latter`s lack of ability, especially in comparison to that of the elder brother. When Naruto recognises these traits in himself, Hagoromo reveals to him that he is the reincarnation of his youngest son.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"八門遁甲の陣\"},{\"title\":\"The Sage of the Six Paths\",\"number\":421,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hagoromo reveals to Naruto that he is the reincarnation of his younger son: Asura. He asks Naruto if he can guess who Indra`s reincarnation is, and Naruto correctly concludes it is Sasuke. At the same time, Hagoromo has the same conversation with Sasuke, revealing his status as Indra`s reincarnation, and having him realise Naruto is Asura`s. Hagoromo goes on to explain that Hashirama and Madara are the previous reincarnations, and that by taking Hashirama`s power, Madara recreated Hagoromo`s chakra, awakening the Rinnegan, despite leaving Indra`s descendants instructions against it. Hagoromo explains that his mother Kaguya used her powerful doujutsu to rule over humanity, and that Madara is on his way to acquiring that same power. Hagoromo asks Naruto to stop Madara, who accepts his request. The chakra of the tailed beasts converge, and Hagoromo notes the prophecy he heard long ago has come true. As entrusting only Asura had created so much conflict, Hagoromo asks Sasuke to cooperate as well, and entrusts both Naruto and Sasuke with his powers. Having survived and being impressed by Guy`s Evening Elephant, Madara asks Guy to keep on fighting him, deeming him the strongest taijutsu user he has ever faced. Guy prepares to use his last technique while Naruto and Sasuke awaken. As Guy prepares the Night Guy, Kakashi recalls his father`s accurate prediction of Guy`s potential when they were children. Guy`s powerful kick lands on Madara, through the Shinju, almost killing him. Guy`s body begins to disintegrate and an elated Madara, regenerating from the attack, attempts to finish him with a Truth-Seeking Ball only for Naruto to kick it away, much to his surprise. Naruto touches Guy, stopping his life force from fading. Madara notices a change in Naruto, wondering what Obito did. Naruto declares he feels he can change the world with his new powers.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"六道仙人\"},{\"title\":\"The Ones Who Will Inherit\",\"number\":422,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Konohamaru cleans Naruto`s apartment. Soon after that, Naruto returns home from his long training, with Team Ebisu and Sakura meeting up with him. Konohamaru shows Naruto his improved Sexy Technique, but the boy reveals that he has already created an advanced version of the technique, only to be hit by Sakura for being a pervert. Naruto and Konohamaru then come back to Naruto`s apartment, with the boy putting his old jacket into one of the drawers for safe keeping. After that, Naruto is shown to begin teaching Konohamaru Rasengan, who`s imagining that he`s being taught an advanced version of the Sexy Technique. Naruto then impresses Konohamaru by showing him the Rasengan first-hand and gives him a water balloon, telling him to practice rotation. Soon after that, Gaara is kidnapped by the Akatsuki and Naruto leaves to help him. In the meantime, Konohamaru, not comprehending the rotation aspect of the technique, asks Kiba, Chouji and Hinata to help him out, but to no avail. Deciding to heat-up the sexiness of his Sexy Technique, Team Ebisu goes to Ebisu for some help, thinking that it would help Konohamaru learn the Rasengan more quickly. Taking a few magazines from his sensei, the team takes their leave. Later, using the Transformation Technique to transform into a girl spinning a hula-hoop, Konohamaru, with enough practice, pops the water balloon using chakra and shows it to Naruto, who gives him a rubber ball and tells him to practice power. Having no idea how to do it, Konohamaru, alongside Moegi and Udon, go ask Ebisu for help again. Meeting him in the park, alongside Iruka, all three transform into sexy girls and asks which one, in his opinion, is the most attractive. Ebisu then gives some advice to Konohamaru, which inspires him to use his Sexy Technique to transform into a girl, hiding her breasts and then revealing them, sending Ebisu flying with a bloody nose, in a comedic fashion. Soon after that, Konohamaru begins training again, determined to learn the technique.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"受け継がれるもの\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Rival\",\"number\":423,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade is frustrated that Orochimaru has escaped her grasp again. Shizune informs her that Konohamaru has been learning the Rasengan from Naruto, to which she makes a bet whether he will master it or not. Meanwhile, Konohamaru uses his Sexy Technique to pop the rubber ball, given to him by Naruto. The boy then decides to visit Naruto and show his accomplishment, learning that he has been practicing Wind Release. Konohamaru then shows him that now he can burst the rubber ball, with Yamato and Kakashi flustered by how he does it — using Sexy Technique. Proud of Konohamaru, Naruto creates a shadow clone and tells him to do this next, only for the boy to reply that he can`t. Konohamaru then issues a challenge to Naruto, saying that he will learn the Shadow Clone Technique before Naruto can complete his current step in Wind Release training. After a few failed attempts at the technique, Konohamaru collapses, with Moegi and Udon going to Sakura for some food pills, which she has been giving to Naruto for training. After a few days, Naruto completes his training and Konohamaru loses the challenge. Later, Kotetsu and Izumo inform Konohamaru and Naruto about the death of Asuma Sarutobi and, soon after that, the jounin`s funeral is held. While Naruto fought Kakuzu, Konohamaru managed to learn the Shadow Clone Technique. Konohamaru then begins the final step of the training, with both him and Naruto forming the Rasengan with Tsunade and Shizune observing them. After leaving for Mount Myouboku to learn Senjutsu, Naruto asks Konohamaru to take care of his treasure - his old orange jacket. During Pain`s Assault, Konohamaru manages to use the Rasengan, and with it, defeat Naraka Path. When Naruto returns, Konohamaru reveals that, despite the village`s explosion, he managed to save Naruto`s old jacket, by storing it in the village`s valuables storage in the evacuation shelter.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトのライバル\"},{\"title\":\"To Rise Up\",\"number\":424,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara is puzzled by Naruto stopping Guy`s chakra from fading. Madara defends himself from Naruto`s punch with his remaining Truth-Seeking Ball, noticing an increase in Naruto`s power. With Son Gokuu`s chakra, Naruto creates a lava Rasenshuriken and attacks Madara and the tree with it, dodging Madara`s Limbo: Border Jail. Naruto`s attack severs the tree, which appears to tell Madara to absorb it, which Madara does. Naruto takes Guy to Lee and Gaara. In Kamui`s dimension, Sakura thanks Obito for saving Naruto, and Obito has a request for her. Sasuke frees Tobirama from Madara`s black rods, Tobirama notices a change in him, and Sasuke asks if Tobirama can teleport him. Madara recovers from having absorbed the tree, telling Naruto he can`t be defeated. Naruto picks up one of his father`s kunai, powering up with his own Truth-Seeking Balls, that he would not be alone, as Sasuke appears beside him with a newly awakened Rinnegan. Madara notes he himself possesses both their powers, and prepares to fight. Madara attacks, but Naruto deflects the attack and Sasuke evades it completely. Madara realises they have discovered the working of his Limbo when Naruto and Sasuke ready their jutsu. Madara escapes their simultaneous attack by sacrificing his Limbo, and flies away to steal Kakashi`s Sharingan. Sasuke manages to cut Madara in half, but he manages to warp into Kamui`s dimension. There he attacks Sakura, who at Obito`s request, is about to destroy the Rinnegan so Black Zetsu can`t get it for Madara.\\nSource: naruto.wikia.com\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"立つ\"},{\"title\":\"The Infinite Dream\",\"number\":425,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara now possesses the Rinnegan in both eyes, and he is the strongest, most despicable enemy the newly reunited Team 7 has ever faced. Kakashi calls upon Team 7 to recall their first lesson with the bells, and to use teamwork!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無限の夢\"},{\"title\":\"The Infinite Tsukuyomi\",\"number\":426,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Madara activates the Infinite Tsukuyomi, and anyone exposed to the light of the full moon--including shinobi and ordinary citizens--loses consciousness. Once ensnared, there is no escape from the Infinite Tsukuyomi. Will mankind be destined to live in a dreamworld forever?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無限月読\"},{\"title\":\"To the Dream World\",\"number\":427,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tenten falls under the Infinite Tsukuyomi and wakes up in the Hidden Leaf Village. When Lee and Guy Sensei appear, Tenten is relieved to see that she is not alone. But her joy is short-lived, as both men act oddly and are dressed stylishly—just where has she been transported to?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夢の世界へ\"},{\"title\":\"Where Tenten Belongs\",\"number\":428,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tenten falls under the Infinite Tsukuyomi and wakes up in the Hidden Leaf Village. When Lee and Guy Sensei appear, Tenten is relieved to see that she is not alone. But her joy is short-lived, as both men act oddly and are dressed stylishly—just where has she been transported to?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"テンテンの居場所\"},{\"title\":\"Killer Bee Rappuden: Part 1\",\"number\":429,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Killer Bee gets caught in the Infinite Tsukuyomi and begins dreaming. In his dream, Jinchuriki are being stripped of their Tailed Beast powers by the Akatsuki. Bee is determined to rescue those who have been captured, and vows to resist the Akatsuki who are coming after him!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"キラービー落風伝・天の巻\"},{\"title\":\"Killer Bee Rappuden: Part 2\",\"number\":430,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Akatsuki summoned the Ten Tails, but the Princess of Rappu Castle sealed it away safely. Unfortunately, the seal will come undone on the next full moon. Now Killer Bee is determined to gather the power of all nine Jinchuriki before the next full moon and protect the princess. But one by one, adversaries who want to stop Bee appear, beginning with Itachi and Deidara, then Orochimaru, Kabuto and Sasuke!  \\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"キラービー落風伝・地の巻\"},{\"title\":\"To See That Smile, Just One More Time\",\"number\":431,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Karin is caught within the Infinite Tsukuyomi and dreams of her past. She was born into the Uzumaki Clan and has the unique ability to heal anyone who bites into her. Driven out of her village, the Hidden Grass takes her in, only to use her for this ability. Karin has no choice but to endure constant suffering in order to survive. She is later chosen to enter the Chunin Exams, where Sasuke saves her life. Karin has never forgotten what he did for her—or his smile.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"あの笑顔をもう一度\"},{\"title\":\"The Loser Ninja\",\"number\":432,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the exception of Naruto’s Team 7, which is protected by the Susano’o, all other shinobi have been swept into a dream world by the Infinite Tsukuyomi. Even the Hokage, Tsunade, has fallen into a dream state. She awakens to find herself in the Leaf Village, where she discovers Jiraiya`s final book, entitled \\\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls,\\\" and begins to read...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 落ちこぼれ忍者\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Search Mission\",\"number\":433,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade continues to read Jiraiya’s novel. Chunin- and jonin-level ninja have gone missing, and the Fourth Hokage, Minato, orders a search mission with teams of genin led by Guy and Kurenai. Kakashi’s Team 7 is also dispatched, but the hero Naruto Uzumaki, despite being the Hokage’s son, has the misfortune of being labeled a loser.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 出撃・探索任務\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Team Jiraiya\",\"number\":434,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade continues to read Jiraiya’s novel. Chunin- and jonin-level ninja have gone missing, and the Fourth Hokage, Minato, orders a search mission with teams of genin led by Guy and Kurenai. Kakashi’s Team 7 is also dispatched, but the hero Naruto Uzumaki, despite being the Hokage’s son, has the misfortune of being labeled a loser.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ チーム・ジライヤ\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Order of Priority\",\"number\":435,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Jiraiya, Shikamaru, and his Leaf teammates are lured into a mysterious village during their battle. A couple children from the village get caught in the crossfire and fall into a cave-in. Yahiko’s team rushes to the rescue, but Shikamaru doesn’t budge. Meanwhile, Naruto and Neji’s teams rendezvous, but a mysterious voice addresses them out of nowhere!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 優先順位\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Masked Man\",\"number\":436,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Masked Man shows Neji and Naruto images of past incidents that occurred in the Leaf Village. Meanwhile, Shikamaru and friends join up with Team Jiraiya to rescue the children. After fighting side by side with the Leaf, Yahiko and the others seem to have a change of heart.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 仮面の男\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Sealed Power\",\"number\":437,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Masked Man is satisfied that the Hidden Leaf Genin chose the importance of life over their mission, but orders his team to continue their surveillance. Meanwhile, Naruto is frustrated at his inabilities, and recalls why his father Minato sealed the Nine Tails inside of him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 封印されし力\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Rules or a Comrade\",\"number\":438,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke and Sakura join up with the others, but the Puppet User appears and blocks their path back to the Hidden Leaf Village. Sasuke wants to bring down the puppets and rush back to report to the Fourth Hokage, but Shikamaru and the others insist on staying and rescuing the jonin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 掟か, 仲間か\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Child of Prophecy\",\"number\":439,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya weakens the seal on the Nine Tails in order to help Naruto learn how to control the Tailed Beast`s power. Jiraiya recalls the words spoken to him years ago by the Great Lord Elder. He told Jiraiya that he would have a student, and that his guidance would decide whether the student would save the Ninja World or destroy it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 予言の子\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Caged Bird\",\"number\":440,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto joins up with the rest of his comrades, and together they overcome the puppet attack. The masked man witnesses this and is convinced there is a future for the young shinobi. He promises to release the kidnapped jonin and begins to explain the truth, and the situation behind his motives.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 籠の鳥\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Returning Home\",\"number\":441,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto’s strength is recognized by his fellow genin, except Sasuke. But while Naruto enjoys a close relationship with his father, Sasuke’s father, Fugaku, constantly compares Sasuke with his older brother Itachi and barely pays attention to him…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 帰還\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Mutual Path\",\"number\":442,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke takes his frustrations out on Naruto and the two begin to fight, this time with their respective new jutsu. Minato steps in just before it turns into a disaster. From this encounter, Sasuke realizes that he is nowhere equal to Naruto in strength and joins the Leaf Police Force, determined to beat him one day.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 互いの道\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Difference in Power\",\"number\":443,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Three years have passed since Sasuke joined the Leaf Police Force, and he`s now lieutenant. But his abusive Police Force has only increased anxiety within the village, and the Uchiha remain in poor regard. Now that his training with Jiraiya has ended, Naruto returns to Hidden Leaf Village and has an explosive encounter with Sasuke in the middle of town!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 力の差\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Leaving the Village\",\"number\":444,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke leaves the village in order to obtain power from Orochimaru. Naruto and his friends learn that Sasuke is in danger and decide to go after him. To keep this a secret, only Naruto and Shikamaru set out on this mission, but on the way the duo are accosted by masked ANBU shinobi!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 里抜け\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Pursuers\",\"number\":445,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Anbu who attack Naruto and Shikamaru are agents sent by Danzo, who had promised Orochimaru that he would deliver Sasuke safely to him. Luckily, Neji, Lee and Tenten rush to their aid in the nick of time! Meanwhile, Hiruko reveals the truth behind the incident involving Hizashi\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 追手\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Collision\",\"number\":446,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto reaches the tower Sasuke was heading for, thanks to Neji, Lee and Tenten deterring the agents from the Foundation. But it`s too late—Sasuke`s already made contact with Orochimaru! Naruto passionately tries to reason with Sasuke, but ultimately their powers collide!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 衝突\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Another Moon\",\"number\":447,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke has left with Orochimaru, but Naruto is not about to give up. Determined to bring Sasuke back, he returns to the village with Shikamaru and the others. Meanwhile, Yahiko appears in the village, calling himself “Pain\\\" and seeking revenge for the Hidden Leaf’s betrayal.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ もう一つの月\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Comrade\",\"number\":448,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Seeing Hinata almost die triggers Naruto’s anger and he goes into Nine Tails State. Naruto`s power is enormous, but Pain releases his jutsu to seal him away. Hatred consumes Naruto as he tries to break the seal. With Naruto unable to calmly control the Nine Tails’ power, the village steadily heads toward destruction.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 仲間\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - The Shinobi Unite\",\"number\":449,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Several months after Pain’s attack, Jiraiya arrives with intel regarding the Akatsuki, who are attacking shinobi villages and kidnapping their Kage and jonin. He also reveals that Sasuke is working with them. Naruto is determined to bring his friend and comrade Sasuke back, once and for all!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 忍達の共演\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls: The Tale of Naruto the Hero - Rival\",\"number\":450,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto wants to bring Sasuke back to the village, but Sasuke burns with a desire to bring Naruto down. Why is Sasuke so confrontational, and how did his feelings toward Naruto develop? The truth rises to the surface during Sasuke’s relentless attack. Where will this battle lead? Find out in the conclusion of the “Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也忍法帳~ナルト豪傑物語~ 好敵手[ライバル]\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - Birth and Death\",\"number\":451,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The shinobi under Madara’s Infinite Tsukuyomi continue to slumber and have pleasant dreams. Meanwhile, Naruto and the others have escaped the genjutsu, thanks to Sasuke’s protective Susano’o. As Sasuke starts remembering the death of Itachi, his Sharingan starts to resonate and show him the truth that Itachi never spoke a word of.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 生まれる命, 死ぬ命\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - The Genius\",\"number\":452,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having experienced the Great Ninja War as a young child, Itachi constantly questions the meaning the life and death, distancing him from other children his age. Soon after entering the Academy, Itachi exhibits his genius and finds himself at the top of his class.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 異才\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - The Pain of Living\",\"number\":453,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Upon graduating from the Academy, Itachi becomes a genin and joins a team that includes Tenma, Shinko, and their Jonin Leader, Minazuki Sensei. They accept a mission from Granny Cat to look for a missing feline who`s a skilled Ninja Cat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 命の痛み\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - Shisui`s Request\",\"number\":454,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi accompanies his friend Shisui on a three-part training exercise. The two come across a battle between the Hokage’s ANBU and the Foundation. Itachi is confused by their motives and can`t discern which side is right or wrong. But Shisui is unwavering in his determination to stop the fighting.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ シスイの依頼\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - Moonlit Night\",\"number\":455,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi joins the ANBU and is quickly promoted to captain. But he must report directly to Danzo, and is placed as a double agent to observe the Uchiha clan, who are in the midst of planning a coup d’état. With dissatisfaction rising within the clan, the Uchiha ultimately decide to carry out their revolt, and the fateful night approaches.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 月夜\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - The Darkness of the Akatsuki\",\"number\":456,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi becomes a rogue ninja and joins the Akatsuki. He is welcomed and introduced by Pain and Orochimaru as the ex-Leaf ANBU and the man who massacred his entire clan. Itachi is paired up with a man named Juzo, and their first job together is to fulfill an assassination request in the Land of Water.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 暁の闇\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - Partner\",\"number\":457,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi is partnered with Kisame and begins his missions as a member of the Akatsuki. The duo succeeds in recruiting Deidara, so Pain assigns the newly formed team of Deidara and Sasori to hunt down the deserter Orochimaru. Meanwhile, intel comes in about an immortal killer, so Itachi, Konan and Kakuzu head out to the Land of Steam.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 相棒\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi`s Story: Light and Darkness - Truth\",\"number\":458,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Itachi confronts Sasuke, who for years bore the shame and anger that Itachi brought upon their clan. The truth behind Itachi’s story comes to light. Back on the battlefield of the Fourth Great Ninja War, Naruto and the others fight Madara, and just as he is declaring his victory, something unexpected occurs...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イタチ真伝篇~光と闇~ 真\"},{\"title\":\"She of the Beginning\",\"number\":459,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaguya Otsutsuki suddenly emerges from Madara’s body. She is the mother of Hagoromo, the Sage of the Six Paths who entrusted his powers to Naruto and Sasuke. Kaguya’s power is immense and instantly sends Naruto and Sasuke to an alternate dimension. Naruto and Sasuke are the only ones who can seal away Kaguya, but they can’t find a jutsu that works against her!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"はじまりのもの\"},{\"title\":\"Kaguya Otsutsuki\",\"number\":460,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaguya Otsutsuki suddenly descends from the heavens as the people of the Land of Sou look on in surprise and suspicion. But their king, Tenji, is enthralled by her and takes her for his concubine. In this age of endless war, Kaguya wishes for nothing but peace. But as the self-proclaimed protector of the Divine Tree, she soon finds herself engulfed by the tides of chaos and war.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"大筒木カグヤ\"},{\"title\":\"Hagoromo and Hamura\",\"number\":461,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Near the Divine Tree is an area known as the Peak of Demise. No one is allowed to go near it, except those chosen by Kaguya to undergo a ritual she has established. Gamamaru, a Sage Toad, says the truth lies beyond the peak—those words stir Hagoromo’s curiosity, and he decides to head out to investigate.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ハゴロモとハムラ\"},{\"title\":\"A Fabricated Past\",\"number\":462,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaguya is furious that Hagoromo has broken the law. Hagoromo finds out what Kaguya did in the past and makes up his mind to fight her. Knowing nothing about her, Hagoromo cannot trust her—he wonders if the love and the despair she experienced are the sole cause of her anger. Unable to reach an understanding, mother and sons begin their long, sad battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"造られた過去\"},{\"title\":\"The No. 1 Most Unpredictable Ninja\",\"number\":463,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Black Zetsu reveals that he masterminded and influenced all the events from the end of Ashura and Indra`s era to the current Fourth Great Ninja War. Naruto rejects Black Zetsu’s claim that the entire history of shinobi was solely for the resurrection of his mother, Kaguya. Naruto and Sasuke work together to seal away Kaguya, but they can`t find a way to counter her.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"意外性ナンバーワン!\"},{\"title\":\"Ninshu: The Ninja Creed\",\"number\":464,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Infinite Tsukuyomi does not affect Hashirama, Tobirama, Hiruzen and Minato because they are reanimated. Hagoromo, the Sage of the Six Paths, appears and explains to the four that Hashirama and Madara are the reincarnations of his sons Ashura and Indra. Hagoromo recounts the tale of how he founded Ninshu, the Ninja Creed, and about the lives of Ashura and Indra.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍宗[にんしゅう]\"},{\"title\":\"Ashura and Indra\",\"number\":465,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hagoromo`s two sons, Ashura and Indra, share a happy childhood, training and playing together. Indra is naturally gifted with great talent, and at a tender age is nicknamed the “genius of Ninshu.” On the other hand, Ashura has no aptitude for Ninshu. Still, the two boys are very close. But Hagoromo is unaware of the malevolent power stirring in the shadows…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アシュラとインドラ\"},{\"title\":\"The Tumultuous Journey\",\"number\":466,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hagoromo sends the brothers to two battle-scarred regions left untouched since the fight with Ten Tails. He then announces that he will choose his successor depending on the outcome of their missions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"試練の旅\"},{\"title\":\"Ashura`s Decision\",\"number\":467,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ashura sets out on a journey, intending never to return. He ends up in a village where the people suffer from a mysterious illness.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アシュラの決意\"},{\"title\":\"The Successor\",\"number\":468,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Everyone believes that Indra is the best choice to be Hagomoro`s successor, and the sage`s indecision begins to cause anxiety among his followers. Finally, Ashura returns home, and Hagoromo reveals who he has chosen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"後継者\"},{\"title\":\"A Special Mission\",\"number\":469,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally, the truth will be revealed... Do not miss the unveiling of the legend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特別任務\"},{\"title\":\"Connecting Thoughts\",\"number\":470,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Before Naruto and Sasuke can attempt to seal Kaguya away, she transports Sasuke into a different Time-Space. Obito realizes that Kaguya’s ability to travel through Time-Space is similar to Kakashi’s and his own Visual Prowess. Obito and Sakura team up and begin the search for Sasuke.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"繋がる想い\"},{\"title\":\"The Two of Them... Always\",\"number\":471,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fearing that he will once again break a promise, Obito uses the last of his power to bring Sasuke and Sakura back, but the thought of his inability to protect Rin nags at him as he loses consciousness.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二人をちゃんと\"},{\"title\":\"You Better...\",\"number\":472,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Recalling the time when he shared Naruto’s desire to become Hokage, Obito opens up to Naruto about his dreams. \\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お前は必ず\"},{\"title\":\"The Sharingan Revived\",\"number\":473,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chakra—whose energy connects this world to those beyond—allows Obito to leave Rin`s side for a moment and appear in Kakashi’s inner psyche. Obito gives him his Magekyo Sharingan and leaves with a parting wish that Kakashi become the Sixth Hokage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"写輪眼, 再び\"},{\"title\":\"Congratulations\",\"number\":474,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team 7 joins forces and succeeds in sealing away Kaguya, and the Tailed Beasts that Kaguya absorbed are also freed. Black Zetsu escapes the seal to lie in wait for another time to resurrect his mother, but Naruto is not about to let him go!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おめでとう\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Valley\",\"number\":475,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle with Kaguya is over, and all that is left is for Naruto and Sasuke to combine their powers and release the Infinite Tsukuyomi. But before they can do this, Sasuke makes a shocking declaration.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"終末の谷\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Battle\",\"number\":476,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke have both become such high-level shinobi that each knows exactly what the other is thinking just by exchanging attacks. Despite knowing how Naruto feels, Sasuke is determined to cut him down.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の闘い\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto and Sasuke\",\"number\":477,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke have both become such high-level shinobi that each knows exactly what the other is thinking just by exchanging attacks. Despite knowing how Naruto feels, Sasuke is determined to cut him down.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトとサスケ\"},{\"title\":\"The Unison Sign\",\"number\":478,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke are enveloped in a huge, intense light after exchanging attacks. When they come to, scenes from their childhood unfold. Is this just a figment of their imagination? Or could this be the afterlife?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"和解の印\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto Uzumaki\",\"number\":479,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"I`ll be a better shinobi than Lord Hokage! Then all the villagers will have to acknowledge my existence at last!\\\" True to his word, Naruto has walked his own path until there are none who do not recognize that he`s become a great shinobi and a hero who has saved the world. But what path will Naruto take now? How will the world of the shinobi change? This is the story of the boy who blew through the hearts of all like a \\\"shippu,\\\" an irresistible gale. This is the story of Naruto Uzumaki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"うずまきナルト!!\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto / Hinata\",\"number\":480,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As a result of having the Nine Tails sealed inside of him, Naruto is feared and hated by the villagers. He trains all alone in the woods, but one day, a certain man appears and strikes up a conversation with Naruto. Elsewhere, in the Leaf Village, a celebration is held to mark Hinata`s third birthday, where she meets Neji for the first time.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"NARUTO / HINATA\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke / Sakura\",\"number\":481,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As a child, Sasuke craved attention from his older brother Itachi. Sasuke and Itachi have a chance to spend some time alone when their parents are away. Meanwhile, Sakura is very shy and tends to spend her free time by herself. One day, her new friend Ino gives her a present.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"SASUKE / SAKURA\"},{\"title\":\"Gaara / Shikamaru\",\"number\":482,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"Gaara spends his days with Yashamaru, his surrogate parent.\\nMeanwhile, a bored Shikamaru pulls a prank on Choji\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"我愛羅 / SHIKAMARU\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya / Kakashi\",\"number\":483,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ever since he was young, Jiraiya has been a little pervy. He tries to involve Orochimaru in many of his exploits as well as his schemes to get Tsunade’s attention. In Kakashi`s story, we see him living on his own since his father, Sakumo, died. Rin and Obito are fascinated by Kakashi, but his aloofness makes him hard to figure out.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"自来也 / KAKASHI\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Story: Sunrise, Part 1 - The Exploding Human\",\"number\":484,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"The fourth Great Shinobi World War has ended. But Sasuke decides to continue his solitary journey—this time to atone for his sins.\\nMeanwhile, back at the Leaf Village, there is a growing number of missing shinobi. As Kakashi—the sixth Hokage—and the others discuss these incidents, the Leaf is attacked by a mysterious group of shinobi.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケ真伝 来光篇 起爆人間\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Story: Sunrise, Part 2 - Coliseum\",\"number\":485,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Instead of returning to the Hidden Leaf, Sasuke sets out with Chino and Nowaki to investigate the cause of the exploding humans.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケ真伝 来光篇 闘技場[コロシアム]\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Story: Sunrise, Part 3 - Fuushin\",\"number\":486,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru brings Sasuke to the Coliseum fighting ring, to lure out En Oyashiro, who may have some information regarding the Exploding Human incident. The match is called off when more Exploding Humans appear and the opportunity to meet Oyashiro seems lost. However, impressed by Sasuke’s Sharingan, Oyashiro approaches him in person. \\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケ真伝 来光篇 風心\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Story: Sunrise, Part 4 - The Ketsuryugan\",\"number\":487,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke uncovers Fuushin’s true identity at last, and begins to fight him. The moment Sasuke tries to read Fuushin’s memories with his Sharingan, a wave of genjutsu from a massive red eye causes Sasuke to lose consciousness. He awakens to find himself alone, and sees tracks in the snow that indicate Fuushin has barely escaped alive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケ真伝 来光篇 血龍眼\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Story: Sunrise, Part 5 - The Last One\",\"number\":488,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke begins his own investigation into the incidents. He overcomes many dangers on his path to the truth. The Exploding Humans, the Ketsuryugan, the Chinoike Clan, and the Uchiha Clan—just how are they connected? Where does his journey lead? The mystery is about to be solved...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サスケ真伝 来光篇 最後の一人\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Story: A Cloud Drifting in the Silent Dark, Part 1 - The State of Affairs\",\"number\":489,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s been two years since the end of the Fourth Great Ninja War. Shikamaru now has an important role within the Hidden Leaf government, and as a representative of the Leaf in the Alliance. One day, a situation develops with shinobi disappearing in droves, and Shikamaru takes on a dangerous mission.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマル秘伝 闇の黙に浮ぶ雲 風雲\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Story: A Cloud Drifting in the Silent Dark, Part 2 - Dark Clouds\",\"number\":490,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the Great War, many missing and Rogue Ninja made their way into the Land of Silence. Sai, who has infiltrated the region to investigate, sends a cryptic message back to the Leaf. Shikamaru, determined to find out what`s happening, heads for the Land of Silence with two members of the ANBU, Soku and Ro. However, they must first get past a heavily guarded checkpoint.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマル秘伝 闇の黙に浮ぶ雲 暗雲\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Story: A Cloud Drifting in the Silent Dark, Part 3 - Recklessness\",\"number\":491,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru and his team are within range of Fushu Castle, where Gengo is purported to be. But they are unable to glean any intel about the man. Learning that Gengo will make a public appearance, Shikamaru and company infiltrate the square, where they see Sai being held captive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマル秘伝 闇の黙に浮かぶ雲 闇雲\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Story: A Cloud Drifting in the Silent Dark, Part 4 - Cloud of Suspicion\",\"number\":492,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru is captured while trying to save Sai and stop Gengo. Far from giving up, he racks his brain to find a away out of the situation. Just as an opportunity presents itself, Ro and Soku appear under Gengo’s control!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマル秘伝 闇の黙に浮かぶ雲 疑雲\"},{\"title\":\"Shikamaru`s Story: A Cloud Drifting in the Silent Dark, Part 5 - Dawn\",\"number\":493,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ino, Choji, and Temari rush to Shikamaru’s aid! Choji takes on Ro, Temari goes after Soku, and Ino goes after Sai! Meanwhile, Shikamaru pursues Gengo. Can Shikamaru defeat Gengo’s evil ambitions? The final battle begins!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマル秘伝 闇の黙に浮かぶ雲 東雲\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 1 - Naruto`s Wedding\",\"number\":494,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Hinata’s wedding day has been set. As the date approaches, Kakashi encounters a problem: Naruto’s friends are all top shinobi—the first line of defense in the village. They work 24/7, and there are always a few who cannot attend celebrations. As Kakashi tries to find the most reasonable solution, he announces a super-secret mission to find the couple a wedding gift.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 ナルトの結婚\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 2 - A Full-Powered Wedding Gift\",\"number\":495,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Hinata’s wedding day has been set. As the date approaches, Kakashi encounters a problem: Naruto’s friends are all top shinobi—the first line of defense in the village. They work 24/7, and there are always a few who cannot attend celebrations. As Kakashi tries to find the most reasonable solution, he announces a super-secret mission to find the couple a wedding gift.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 フルパワー結婚祝い\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 3 - Steam and Food Pills\",\"number\":496,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The super-secret mission to find Naruto and Hinata a wedding gift proves to be difficult for Shikamaru. Choji has found the perfect gift, which adds to Shikamaru`s panic. But then Choji mentions something in passing and Shikamaru gets an idea. All he needs now is to enlist Temari`s help!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 湯けむりと兵糧丸\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 4 - The Kazekage`s Wedding Gift\",\"number\":497,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Tsuchikage and Raikage, who are in the Leaf Village to attend the Five Kage Summit, mention that they have already prepared wedding gifts for Naruto. Gaara finds himself in a dilemma. He`s advised that the gift should be something that befits the Kazekage. He also learns that the Raikage is planning to perform a dance. Kankuro chimes in and suggests Gaara should dance as well—further plunging Gaara into indecision.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 風影の御祝\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 5 - The Last Mission\",\"number\":498,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shino and Kiba still don`t have a wedding gift for Hinata`s wedding. Kiba`s made it his goal to become the next Hokage, but unlike his teammates, who are steadfastly chasing their dreams, Shino is unsure about his. With this uncertainty, he sets out with Kiba and Akamaru on their final mission as Team 8!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 最後の任務\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 6 - The Outcome of the Secret Mission\",\"number\":499,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto had once lived a lonely existence, ostracized by everyone. But Iruka`s words and his very presence have supported Naruto to this day. As Naruto`s wedding nears, Iruka begins to lose sight of what he was to Naruto, and is unsure of what to say for his message.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 極秘任務の行方\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Leaf Story: The Perfect Day for a Wedding, Part 7 - The Message\",\"number\":500,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto had once lived a lonely existence, ostracized by everyone. But Iruka`s words and his very presence have supported Naruto to this day. As Naruto`s wedding nears, Iruka begins to lose sight of what he was to Naruto, and is unsure of what to say for his message.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉秘伝 祝言日和 祝いの言葉\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}